window.W3_DASHBOARD_UNITS = [{"unit":1,"theme":"acre – surface","cards":[{"w":"acre","p":"n.","d":"a unit for measuring land, about 4,000 square meters","c":"英畝","s":"The farmer sold one acre of his land to build a small school for the village.","t":"那位農夫賣掉一英畝的土地，為村莊蓋一所小學校。"},{"w":"afterlife","p":"n.","d":"a life that some people believe begins after death","c":"來生","s":"The ancient kings filled their tombs with gold because they believed in an afterlife.","t":"古代的國王把陵墓裝滿黃金，因為他們相信有來生。"},{"w":"archaeology","p":"n.","d":"the study of ancient people through the things they left behind","c":"考古學","s":"She studies archaeology because she loves digging up old cities and learning how people lived long ago.","t":"她研究考古學，因為她喜歡挖掘古城並了解古人的生活。"},{"w":"chamber","p":"n.","d":"a room used for a special purpose","c":"房間；會議室","s":"The king's body was placed in a secret chamber deep inside the pyramid.","t":"國王的遺體被安放在金字塔深處的一間密室裡。"},{"w":"channel","p":"n.","d":"a long, narrow path that water flows through","c":"頻道；水道","s":"The workers dug a channel to carry water from the river to the dry fields.","t":"工人們挖了一條水道，把河水引到乾旱的田地。"},{"w":"core","p":"n.","d":"the central or most important part of something","c":"核心","s":"The core of the earth is so hot that even rock and metal melt there.","t":"地球的核心非常熱，連岩石和金屬都會熔化。"},{"w":"corridor","p":"n.","d":"a long, narrow passage inside a building with rooms on the sides","c":"走廊","s":"Walk down this corridor and you will find the teachers' office at the end.","t":"沿著這條走廊走，你會在盡頭找到教師辦公室。"},{"w":"distinct","p":"adj.","d":"clearly different from others; easy to notice","c":"截然不同的；明顯的","s":"The two brothers look alike, but they have very distinct personalities.","t":"這對兄弟長得很像，但個性截然不同。"},{"w":"elite","p":"adj.","d":"belonging to the best or most powerful group","c":"菁英的","s":"Only the elite soldiers of the army were chosen to guard the president.","t":"只有軍隊裡的菁英士兵被選去保護總統。"},{"w":"engineer","p":"v.","d":"to design and build something using skill and science","c":"設計；建造","s":"It took a large team ten years to engineer a bridge strong enough to cross the wide sea.","t":"一個大團隊花了十年才設計建造出足以跨越大海的堅固橋樑。"},{"w":"found","p":"v.","d":"to start an organization, school, or city","c":"創立；建立","s":"The two friends decided to found a company that makes toys for blind children.","t":"這兩位朋友決定創立一家為盲童製作玩具的公司。"},{"w":"gap","p":"n.","d":"an empty space between two things","c":"縫隙；缺口","s":"The little mouse escaped through a gap between the door and the floor.","t":"小老鼠從門和地板之間的縫隙逃走了。"},{"w":"glory","p":"n.","d":"great honor and praise that someone wins","c":"榮耀；壯麗","s":"The young soldier dreamed of winning glory for his country in the war.","t":"這位年輕士兵夢想在戰爭中為國家贏得榮耀。"},{"w":"interior","p":"n.","d":"the inside part of something","c":"內部","s":"The outside of the old house looks plain, but its interior is warm and beautiful.","t":"這棟老房子外表樸素，但內部溫暖又漂亮。"},{"w":"lion","p":"n.","d":"a large, powerful wild cat that lives mainly in Africa","c":"獅子","s":"The lion is called the king of animals because it is strong and has no fear.","t":"獅子被稱為萬獸之王，因為牠強壯又無所畏懼。"},{"w":"role","p":"n.","d":"the part that someone has in a job, a group, or a story","c":"角色；職責","s":"Parents play an important role in teaching their children right from wrong.","t":"父母在教導孩子分辨是非上扮演重要的角色。"},{"w":"royal","p":"adj.","d":"belonging to a king or queen or their family","c":"皇室的","s":"Thousands of people stood in the street to watch the royal wedding of the prince.","t":"成千上萬的人站在街上觀看王子的皇室婚禮。"},{"w":"sole","p":"adj.","d":"being the only one","c":"唯一的","s":"The little girl was the sole survivor of the accident; everyone else in the car died.","t":"那個小女孩是事故中唯一的倖存者，車上其他人都喪生了。"},{"w":"stairs","p":"n.","d":"a set of steps that lead from one floor to another","c":"樓梯","s":"The elevator was broken, so we had to climb the stairs to the tenth floor.","t":"電梯壞了，所以我們只好爬樓梯到十樓。"},{"w":"surface","p":"n.","d":"the outside or top layer of something","c":"表面","s":"Leaves and small insects were floating on the surface of the quiet lake.","t":"樹葉和小昆蟲漂浮在平靜的湖面上。"}]},{"unit":2,"theme":"agreement – sustain","cards":[{"w":"agreement","p":"n.","d":"a decision or promise that two or more people make together","c":"協議；同意","s":"After talking for five hours, the two companies finally reached an agreement on the price.","t":"談了五個小時後，兩家公司終於在價格上達成協議。"},{"w":"arise","p":"v.","d":"to begin to exist or happen","c":"出現；發生","s":"Call me right away if any problems arise while I am out of the office.","t":"我不在辦公室時如果出現任何問題，請馬上打電話給我。"},{"w":"benefactor","p":"n.","d":"a person who gives money or help to others","c":"恩人；捐助者","s":"A rich benefactor paid for the poor boy's education, but nobody knew who he was.","t":"一位富有的恩人支付了窮男孩的學費，但沒人知道他是誰。"},{"w":"blacksmith","p":"n.","d":"a person who makes things out of iron by heating and hammering it","c":"鐵匠","s":"The blacksmith heated the metal in the fire and hammered it into a horseshoe.","t":"鐵匠把金屬放在火裡加熱，再把它敲打成馬蹄鐵。"},{"w":"chimney","p":"n.","d":"a pipe that carries smoke from a fire up and out of a building","c":"煙囪","s":"Black smoke rose from the chimney of the little house on the cold winter morning.","t":"寒冷的冬日早晨，黑煙從小屋的煙囪升起。"},{"w":"compensate","p":"v.","d":"to pay someone for something they have lost or suffered","c":"補償；賠償","s":"The airline promised to compensate the passengers for their lost bags.","t":"航空公司承諾賠償乘客遺失的行李。"},{"w":"encounter","p":"v.","d":"to meet someone or something, often by surprise","c":"遭遇；邂逅","s":"Hikers in these mountains sometimes encounter wild bears, so they carry bells.","t":"在這些山裡健行的人有時會遇到野熊，所以他們會帶鈴鐺。"},{"w":"exceed","p":"v.","d":"to be greater than a number or limit","c":"超過；超出","s":"Drivers who exceed the speed limit on this road will have to pay a heavy fine.","t":"在這條路上超速的駕駛必須繳交高額罰款。"},{"w":"forge","p":"v.","d":"to shape hot metal with a hammer; to build something strong","c":"鍛造；締造","s":"The old man taught his son how to forge a sword out of hot iron.","t":"老人教他的兒子如何用熱鐵鍛造一把劍。"},{"w":"humble","p":"adj.","d":"not thinking you are better than other people","c":"謙虛的","s":"Although he is a world-famous doctor, he is humble and never talks about his success.","t":"雖然他是世界知名的醫生，但他很謙虛，從不談論自己的成就。"},{"w":"iron","p":"n.","d":"a strong, hard metal used to make steel","c":"鐵","s":"The gate of the old castle was made of heavy iron and took four men to open.","t":"古堡的大門是用沉重的鐵做的，要四個人才能打開。"},{"w":"ladder","p":"n.","d":"a tool with steps that you climb to reach high places","c":"梯子","s":"Dad stood on a ladder to change the light bulb on the ceiling.","t":"爸爸站在梯子上換天花板上的燈泡。"},{"w":"modest","p":"adj.","d":"not talking much about your own skills; not very large","c":"謙遜的；適度的","s":"She gave a modest smile and said that winning the prize was just good luck.","t":"她露出謙遜的微笑，說得獎只是運氣好。"},{"w":"occupy","p":"v.","d":"to fill or use a space or period of time","c":"佔據；居住","s":"Books and papers occupy most of the space on his small desk.","t":"書和文件佔據了他小書桌上大部分的空間。"},{"w":"penny","p":"n.","d":"a coin of very small value","c":"便士；一分錢","s":"The poor boy saved every penny he earned until he could buy a pair of shoes.","t":"窮男孩把賺到的每一分錢存起來，直到買得起一雙鞋。"},{"w":"preach","p":"v.","d":"to give a talk about religion or about how people should behave","c":"說教；佈道","s":"Parents should do what they preach; children learn from actions, not words.","t":"父母應該做到自己所說的道理；孩子是從行為學習，而不是從話語。"},{"w":"prosper","p":"v.","d":"to be successful, especially in making money","c":"繁榮；成功","s":"With good weather and hard work, the small farming village began to prosper.","t":"靠著好天氣和辛勤工作，這個小農村開始繁榮起來。"},{"w":"province","p":"n.","d":"one of the large areas that some countries are divided into","c":"省","s":"Canada's largest province is Quebec, where most people speak French.","t":"加拿大最大的省是魁北克，那裡大多數人說法語。"},{"w":"satisfaction","p":"n.","d":"the good feeling you have when you get what you wanted","c":"滿意；滿足","s":"She looked at her clean room with satisfaction after three hours of hard work.","t":"辛苦打掃三小時後，她滿意地看著乾淨的房間。"},{"w":"sustain","p":"v.","d":"to keep something going or alive","c":"維持；支撐","s":"One bowl of rice a day is not enough to sustain a growing child.","t":"一天一碗飯不足以維持一個成長中孩子的生命。"}]},{"unit":3,"theme":"acquire – wheat","cards":[{"w":"acquire","p":"v.","d":"to get or gain something","c":"獲得；取得","s":"Living in Spain for a year is a good way to acquire the language quickly.","t":"在西班牙住一年是快速學會這種語言的好方法。"},{"w":"awkward","p":"adj.","d":"embarrassing and uncomfortable; not graceful","c":"尷尬的；笨拙的","s":"There was an awkward silence when he forgot the name of his own boss.","t":"當他忘記自己老闆的名字時，場面陷入一陣尷尬的沉默。"},{"w":"caretaker","p":"n.","d":"a person whose job is to look after a building or a person","c":"照顧者；看護","s":"The school caretaker locks all the doors and turns off the lights every evening.","t":"學校的管理員每天傍晚鎖上所有的門並關燈。"},{"w":"deceive","p":"v.","d":"to make someone believe something that is not true","c":"欺騙","s":"He tried to deceive the old woman by saying he worked for the bank.","t":"他謊稱自己在銀行工作，企圖欺騙那位老婦人。"},{"w":"discourage","p":"v.","d":"to make someone feel less hopeful or less willing to do something","c":"勸阻；使氣餒","s":"Don't let one bad grade discourage you; just keep studying hard.","t":"別讓一次壞成績使你氣餒，繼續努力讀書就好。"},{"w":"fake","p":"adj.","d":"not real, but made to look real","c":"假冒的；偽造的","s":"The police found that the expensive painting was fake and worth nothing.","t":"警方發現那幅昂貴的畫是假的，一文不值。"},{"w":"hatred","p":"n.","d":"a very strong feeling of not liking someone or something","c":"仇恨；憎恨","s":"Years of war left deep hatred between the people of the two countries.","t":"多年的戰爭在兩國人民之間留下深深的仇恨。"},{"w":"hut","p":"n.","d":"a small, simple house made of wood, mud, or grass","c":"茅屋；小屋","s":"The fisherman lived alone in a small wooden hut by the sea.","t":"漁夫獨自住在海邊的一間小木屋裡。"},{"w":"inferior","p":"adj.","d":"not as good as someone or something else","c":"較差的；次等的","s":"These cheap shoes are inferior to the expensive ones and will not last a month.","t":"這雙便宜的鞋子比貴的差，穿不到一個月。"},{"w":"lodge","p":"n.","d":"a small house in the country where people stay on vacation","c":"山林小屋","s":"We spent the weekend in a ski lodge high in the snowy mountains.","t":"我們在雪山高處的滑雪小屋度過週末。"},{"w":"neglect","p":"v.","d":"to fail to take care of someone or something","c":"忽視；疏忽","s":"If you neglect your teeth, you will have to visit the dentist very often.","t":"如果你疏於照顧牙齒，就得常常去看牙醫。"},{"w":"newcomer","p":"n.","d":"a person who has just arrived in a place or started an activity","c":"新來的人；新手","s":"As a newcomer to the city, she often got lost on the way to work.","t":"身為剛到這座城市的新人，她上班途中常常迷路。"},{"w":"offense","p":"n.","d":"a crime; something that makes a person feel hurt or angry","c":"罪過；冒犯","s":"Driving after drinking is a serious offense in every country.","t":"酒後駕車在每個國家都是嚴重的罪行。"},{"w":"overlook","p":"v.","d":"to fail to notice something; to have a view of something from above","c":"忽略；俯瞰","s":"The editor read the page three times, but she still managed to overlook a spelling mistake.","t":"編輯把那一頁讀了三遍，卻還是漏看了一個拼字錯誤。"},{"w":"repay","p":"v.","d":"to pay back money that you borrowed","c":"償還；報答","s":"He worked two jobs to repay the money he had borrowed from his uncle.","t":"他兼兩份工作來償還向叔叔借的錢。"},{"w":"ridiculous","p":"adj.","d":"very silly and deserving to be laughed at","c":"可笑的；荒謬的","s":"It is ridiculous to wear a heavy coat on such a hot summer day.","t":"在這麼熱的夏天穿厚外套真是荒謬。"},{"w":"satisfactory","p":"adj.","d":"good enough for a need or purpose","c":"令人滿意的","s":"Your work is satisfactory, but I know you can do much better.","t":"你的作業還算令人滿意，但我知道你可以做得更好。"},{"w":"shepherd","p":"n.","d":"a person whose job is to take care of sheep","c":"牧羊人","s":"The shepherd and his dog led the sheep down the hill before dark.","t":"牧羊人和他的狗在天黑前把羊群帶下山。"},{"w":"venture","p":"v.","d":"to go somewhere new or dangerous","c":"冒險","s":"Few people dare to venture into the forest at night because of the wolves.","t":"因為有狼，很少人敢在夜裡冒險進入森林。"},{"w":"wheat","p":"n.","d":"a plant whose grain is used to make flour and bread","c":"小麥","s":"Farmers in this area grow wheat and sell it to bread factories.","t":"這個地區的農民種植小麥並賣給麵包工廠。"}]},{"unit":4,"theme":"alley – valentine","cards":[{"w":"alley","p":"n.","d":"a narrow street between or behind buildings","c":"小巷；弄","s":"The cat ran into a dark alley behind the restaurant to look for food.","t":"那隻貓跑進餐廳後面的暗巷找食物。"},{"w":"ax","p":"n.","d":"a tool with a sharp metal blade used for cutting wood","c":"斧頭","s":"He used an ax to cut down the dead tree in his yard.","t":"他用斧頭砍倒院子裡的枯樹。"},{"w":"bunch","p":"n.","d":"a group of things of the same kind that are held together","c":"一串；一束","s":"She bought a bunch of grapes and a bag of apples at the market.","t":"她在市場買了一串葡萄和一袋蘋果。"},{"w":"chore","p":"n.","d":"a small job at home that you must do regularly","c":"雜務；家事","s":"Washing the dishes is the chore that I hate the most.","t":"洗碗是我最討厭的家事。"},{"w":"decent","p":"adj.","d":"good enough; honest and polite","c":"體面的；相當好的","s":"He finally found a decent job that pays enough to support his family.","t":"他終於找到一份薪水足以養家的像樣工作。"},{"w":"disgraceful","p":"adj.","d":"very bad and making people feel ashamed","c":"可恥的；不光彩的","s":"It is disgraceful that the rich man refused to help his own sick mother.","t":"那個有錢人拒絕幫助自己生病的母親，真是可恥。"},{"w":"elbow","p":"n.","d":"the middle part of the arm where it bends","c":"手肘","s":"She fell off her bike and hurt her elbow, so she cannot bend her arm.","t":"她從腳踏車上摔下來傷了手肘，所以手臂彎不起來。"},{"w":"grateful","p":"adj.","d":"feeling that you want to thank someone","c":"感激的","s":"I am grateful to my teacher for all the extra help she gave me.","t":"我很感激老師給我的所有額外幫助。"},{"w":"irritate","p":"v.","d":"to make someone a little angry; to make skin sore","c":"激怒；刺激","s":"Loud chewing sounds really irritate my father at the dinner table.","t":"吃飯時大聲咀嚼的聲音真的會惹惱我爸爸。"},{"w":"kid","p":"v.","d":"to say something that is not true as a joke","c":"戲弄；開玩笑","s":"Don't be angry; I did not mean it. I only said it to kid you.","t":"別生氣，我不是認真的，我只是說來跟你開玩笑。"},{"w":"loose","p":"adj.","d":"not tight or firmly fixed","c":"鬆的；鬆散的","s":"One of my teeth is loose, and I think it will fall out soon.","t":"我有一顆牙齒鬆了，我想它很快就會掉。"},{"w":"offend","p":"v.","d":"to make someone angry or upset by what you say or do","c":"冒犯","s":"I did not mean to offend you when I laughed at your new haircut.","t":"我笑你的新髮型時，並不是有意冒犯你。"},{"w":"overnight","p":"adv.","d":"during or for the whole night","c":"在夜間的；徹夜","s":"Heavy snow fell overnight, and the whole town was white in the morning.","t":"大雪下了一整夜，早上整個城鎮一片雪白。"},{"w":"persist","p":"v.","d":"to keep doing something even when it is difficult","c":"堅持","s":"If you persist in practicing every day, you will play the piano well.","t":"如果你堅持每天練習，就能把鋼琴彈好。"},{"w":"pine","p":"n.","d":"a tall tree with thin, sharp leaves that stay green all year","c":"松樹","s":"The air smelled fresh under the tall pine trees in the mountain forest.","t":"在山林裡高大的松樹下，空氣聞起來很清新。"},{"w":"scar","p":"n.","d":"a mark left on the skin after a cut has healed","c":"疤痕","s":"The old soldier has a long scar on his face from the war.","t":"老兵臉上有一道戰爭留下的長疤。"},{"w":"sensation","p":"n.","d":"a feeling in your body","c":"感覺；知覺","s":"After sitting too long, I had a strange sensation in my legs, as if they were asleep.","t":"坐太久之後，我的腿有種奇怪的感覺，好像麻掉了。"},{"w":"sled","p":"n.","d":"a small vehicle used for sliding over snow","c":"雪橇","s":"The children pulled their sled up the hill and rode it down again.","t":"孩子們把雪橇拉上山坡，再坐著滑下來。"},{"w":"tease","p":"v.","d":"to laugh at someone or make jokes about them","c":"嘲笑；戲弄","s":"The older boys tease him about his big glasses every day at school.","t":"年紀大的男孩每天在學校嘲笑他的大眼鏡。"},{"w":"valentine","p":"n.","d":"a person you love, or a card you send to that person on February 14","c":"情人","s":"He asked the girl he loved to be his valentine and gave her red roses.","t":"他請心愛的女孩當他的情人，並送她紅玫瑰。"}]},{"unit":5,"theme":"acquaint – wicked","cards":[{"w":"acquaint","p":"v.","d":"to make someone know or become familiar with something","c":"使熟悉；使認識","s":"New workers should acquaint themselves with the safety rules before using the machines.","t":"新員工使用機器前應先熟悉安全規則。"},{"w":"cemetery","p":"n.","d":"a place where dead people are buried","c":"墓地","s":"We visit my grandfather's grave in the cemetery every spring.","t":"我們每年春天都去墓地看爺爺的墳。"},{"w":"creature","p":"n.","d":"any living thing that is not a plant","c":"生物","s":"The blue whale is the largest creature that has ever lived on the earth.","t":"藍鯨是地球上有史以來最大的生物。"},{"w":"curse","p":"v.","d":"to use magic words to make bad things happen to someone","c":"詛咒","s":"In the story, the witch decided to curse the baby princess with a hundred years of sleep.","t":"故事中，女巫決定詛咒小公主沉睡一百年。"},{"w":"disguise","p":"n.","d":"something you wear to hide who you really are","c":"偽裝；假扮","s":"The thief wore a wig and glasses as a disguise so that nobody would know him.","t":"小偷戴上假髮和眼鏡作為偽裝，讓沒人認得他。"},{"w":"fancy","p":"adj.","d":"special, expensive, or decorated; not plain","c":"華麗的；精緻的","s":"They celebrated their wedding anniversary at a fancy restaurant in a five-star hotel.","t":"他們在五星級飯店的高級餐廳慶祝結婚週年。"},{"w":"flashlight","p":"n.","d":"a small electric light that you carry in your hand","c":"手電筒","s":"When the power went out, Dad used a flashlight to find the candles.","t":"停電時，爸爸用手電筒找蠟燭。"},{"w":"hood","p":"n.","d":"the part of a coat or jacket that covers your head","c":"兜帽；頭巾","s":"It began to rain, so she pulled the hood of her jacket over her head.","t":"開始下雨了，所以她把外套的兜帽拉到頭上。"},{"w":"inhabitant","p":"n.","d":"a person or animal that lives in a place","c":"居民","s":"The oldest inhabitant of the village is a woman who is 103 years old.","t":"村裡最年長的居民是一位一百零三歲的婦人。"},{"w":"nourish","p":"v.","d":"to give a person, animal, or plant the food it needs to live and grow","c":"滋養；養育","s":"Fresh fruit, vegetables, and milk nourish a child's growing body.","t":"新鮮水果、蔬菜和牛奶滋養孩子成長中的身體。"},{"w":"pirate","p":"n.","d":"a person who attacks and robs ships at sea","c":"海盜","s":"The pirate and his men attacked the ship and stole all the gold.","t":"海盜和他的手下襲擊那艘船並偷走所有黃金。"},{"w":"publication","p":"n.","d":"a book, magazine, or newspaper that is printed and sold","c":"出版物","s":"The science magazine is a monthly publication read by students all over the country.","t":"這本科學雜誌是全國學生都在閱讀的月刊。"},{"w":"riddle","p":"n.","d":"a difficult question that has a clever or funny answer","c":"謎語","s":"Here is a riddle: what has hands but cannot clap? The answer is a clock.","t":"這裡有個謎語：什麼東西有手卻不能拍手？答案是時鐘。"},{"w":"rot","p":"v.","d":"to slowly go bad and become soft because of age or water","c":"腐爛","s":"If you leave the apples on the ground, they will rot within a week.","t":"如果你把蘋果留在地上，它們一週內就會腐爛。"},{"w":"shortly","p":"adv.","d":"in a short time; soon","c":"不久；很快","s":"Please take a seat; the doctor will see you shortly.","t":"請坐，醫生很快就會為您看診。"},{"w":"skeleton","p":"n.","d":"all the bones of a person's or an animal's body","c":"骨骼；骷髏","s":"The museum has the skeleton of a dinosaur that lived 65 million years ago.","t":"博物館裡有一具六千五百萬年前恐龍的骨骼。"},{"w":"spoil","p":"v.","d":"to make something less good or enjoyable","c":"變質；破壞","s":"Don't let the bad weather spoil your holiday; there are many things to do indoors.","t":"別讓壞天氣破壞你的假期，室內有很多事可以做。"},{"w":"starve","p":"v.","d":"to suffer or die because there is not enough food","c":"挨餓","s":"Without help from other countries, thousands of people will starve this winter.","t":"如果沒有其他國家的幫助，今年冬天將有數千人挨餓。"},{"w":"thrill","p":"n.","d":"a sudden strong feeling of excitement","c":"興奮；刺激","s":"Riding the roller coaster for the first time gave me a great thrill.","t":"第一次坐雲霄飛車讓我感到非常刺激。"},{"w":"wicked","p":"adj.","d":"very bad or evil","c":"邪惡的；缺德的","s":"In the fairy tale, the wicked queen tries to kill the beautiful young girl.","t":"在童話故事裡，邪惡的皇后企圖殺死美麗的少女。"}]},{"unit":6,"theme":"alert – worm","cards":[{"w":"alert","p":"v.","d":"to warn someone about a danger or problem","c":"警告；提醒","s":"The loud bell will alert everyone in the building if there is a fire.","t":"如果發生火災，響亮的鈴聲會警告大樓裡的每個人。"},{"w":"broadcast","p":"n.","d":"a program on television or radio","c":"廣播節目；播出","s":"Millions of people watched the live broadcast of the final game on TV.","t":"數百萬人在電視上收看決賽的現場轉播。"},{"w":"bulletin","p":"n.","d":"a short news report on television or radio","c":"公報；快報","s":"The program was stopped for a special news bulletin about the earthquake.","t":"節目中斷，插播一則有關地震的特別新聞快報。"},{"w":"bump","p":"n.","d":"a small raised area on the body or on a surface","c":"腫塊；隆起","s":"He hit his head on the door and now has a big bump on it.","t":"他的頭撞到門，現在腫了一個大包。"},{"w":"chop","p":"v.","d":"to cut something into pieces with a knife or an ax","c":"砍；劈；切碎","s":"Please chop the onions and carrots into small pieces for the soup.","t":"請把洋蔥和紅蘿蔔切成小塊來煮湯。"},{"w":"closet","p":"n.","d":"a small room or tall cupboard where clothes are kept","c":"壁櫥；衣櫥","s":"She hung her new dresses in the closet and put her shoes on the floor.","t":"她把新洋裝掛進衣櫥，把鞋子放在地上。"},{"w":"console","p":"v.","d":"to make someone who is sad feel better","c":"安慰","s":"Nothing could console the little boy after his dog died.","t":"小男孩的狗死後，沒有任何事能安慰他。"},{"w":"district","p":"n.","d":"a part of a city or country","c":"區域；地區","s":"He works in the business district, where all the big banks are.","t":"他在商業區工作，所有大銀行都在那裡。"},{"w":"drawer","p":"n.","d":"a box that slides in and out of a desk or cupboard","c":"抽屜","s":"I keep my socks in the top drawer and my T-shirts in the bottom one.","t":"我把襪子放在最上層的抽屜，T恤放在最下層。"},{"w":"endure","p":"v.","d":"to suffer something painful or hard for a long time","c":"忍受；忍耐","s":"The soldiers had to endure cold, hunger, and fear during the long war.","t":"士兵們在漫長的戰爭中必須忍受寒冷、飢餓和恐懼。"},{"w":"execute","p":"v.","d":"to kill someone as a legal punishment; to carry out a plan","c":"處決；執行","s":"In the past, kings would execute people who tried to take their power.","t":"在過去，國王會處決企圖奪權的人。"},{"w":"grasp","p":"v.","d":"to take hold of something firmly","c":"抓緊；握住","s":"The baby reached out to grasp her mother's finger with her tiny hand.","t":"嬰兒伸出小手抓住媽媽的手指。"},{"w":"rear","p":"n.","d":"the back part of something","c":"後部；背面","s":"Please get on at the front of the bus and get off at the rear.","t":"請從公車前門上車，後門下車。"},{"w":"senator","p":"n.","d":"a member of the group that makes laws in some countries","c":"參議員","s":"The senator gave a speech asking for a new law to protect clean water.","t":"參議員發表演說，要求制定保護乾淨水源的新法律。"},{"w":"skull","p":"n.","d":"the bones of the head","c":"頭骨；顱骨","s":"A helmet protects your skull if you fall off your motorcycle.","t":"如果你從機車上摔下來，安全帽能保護你的頭骨。"},{"w":"stir","p":"v.","d":"to mix something by moving a spoon around in it","c":"攪拌","s":"Add some sugar to your coffee and stir it with a spoon.","t":"在咖啡裡加點糖，然後用湯匙攪拌。"},{"w":"tap","p":"v.","d":"to hit something gently and quickly","c":"輕敲；輕拍","s":"I felt someone tap me on the shoulder, so I turned around.","t":"我感覺有人輕拍我的肩膀，於是轉過身。"},{"w":"tremendous","p":"adj.","d":"very large or very great","c":"巨大的；極好的","s":"The rocket took off with a tremendous noise that could be heard for miles.","t":"火箭伴隨著數英里外都聽得見的巨大聲響升空。"},{"w":"underneath","p":"prep.","d":"directly under something","c":"在...底下；在下面","s":"The cat was hiding underneath the sofa and refused to come out.","t":"那隻貓躲在沙發底下，不肯出來。"},{"w":"worm","p":"n.","d":"a small, long, thin animal with no legs that lives in the ground","c":"蠕蟲；蟲","s":"The bird pulled a worm out of the ground and fed it to its babies.","t":"鳥從地裡拉出一條蟲，餵給牠的寶寶。"}]},{"unit":7,"theme":"abandon – veterinarian","cards":[{"w":"abandon","p":"v.","d":"to leave a person, place, or thing and not come back","c":"拋棄；放棄","s":"The sailors had to abandon the ship when it began to sink.","t":"船開始下沉時，水手們不得不棄船。"},{"w":"ambitious","p":"adj.","d":"wanting very much to be successful, rich, or powerful","c":"有野心的；有抱負的","s":"The ambitious young lawyer hopes to become a judge before she is forty.","t":"這位有抱負的年輕律師希望在四十歲前成為法官。"},{"w":"bark","p":"v.","d":"(of a dog) to make a short, loud sound","c":"吠叫","s":"The dogs bark loudly every time the mailman comes to the gate.","t":"每次郵差來到大門口，那些狗就大聲吠叫。"},{"w":"bay","p":"n.","d":"a part of the sea that is partly surrounded by land","c":"海灣","s":"Fishing boats rested quietly in the bay, safe from the strong ocean waves.","t":"漁船靜靜地停在海灣裡，躲避強勁的海浪。"},{"w":"brilliant","p":"adj.","d":"very smart or very bright","c":"聰穎的；傑出的","s":"Einstein was a brilliant scientist who changed the way we understand time.","t":"愛因斯坦是一位傑出的科學家，改變了我們對時間的理解。"},{"w":"chin","p":"n.","d":"the part of the face below the mouth","c":"下巴","s":"He rested his chin on his hand and thought about the question.","t":"他用手托著下巴思考那個問題。"},{"w":"complaint","p":"n.","d":"a statement that you are not happy about something","c":"抱怨；投訴","s":"The customer made a complaint to the manager about the cold food.","t":"顧客向經理投訴食物是冷的。"},{"w":"deaf","p":"adj.","d":"not able to hear","c":"聾的","s":"The deaf boy learned to talk with his hands and to read lips.","t":"那個失聰的男孩學會用手語交談和讀唇語。"},{"w":"enthusiastic","p":"adj.","d":"showing a lot of excitement and interest","c":"熱情的；熱心的","s":"The children were enthusiastic about the trip and packed their bags a week early.","t":"孩子們對這趟旅行非常熱衷，提早一週就打包好行李。"},{"w":"expedition","p":"n.","d":"a long, carefully planned trip to a dangerous or unknown place","c":"遠征；探險","s":"The scientists went on an expedition to the South Pole to study the ice.","t":"科學家們前往南極探險，研究冰層。"},{"w":"horizon","p":"n.","d":"the line far away where the sky seems to meet the land or sea","c":"地平線；視野","s":"We watched the sun slowly sink below the horizon at the end of the day.","t":"我們看著太陽在一天結束時慢慢沉入地平線。"},{"w":"loyal","p":"adj.","d":"always supporting your friends, family, or country","c":"忠誠的；忠實的","s":"A dog is a loyal friend that will never leave its owner.","t":"狗是忠誠的朋友，永遠不會離開主人。"},{"w":"mayor","p":"n.","d":"the leader of a city or town","c":"市長","s":"The people of the city chose a new mayor in last month's election.","t":"市民在上個月的選舉中選出一位新市長。"},{"w":"mutual","p":"adj.","d":"felt or done by two people toward each other; shared","c":"相互的；共同的","s":"A good marriage is built on mutual respect between husband and wife.","t":"美滿的婚姻建立在夫妻的互相尊重上。"},{"w":"overweight","p":"adj.","d":"too heavy or fat","c":"超重的；過胖的","s":"The doctor said my cat is overweight and should eat less and move more.","t":"醫生說我的貓過重，應該少吃多動。"},{"w":"refuge","p":"n.","d":"a place that is safe from danger or trouble","c":"避難所；庇護所","s":"During the storm, the climbers found refuge in a small cave.","t":"暴風雨期間，登山客在一個小山洞裡找到避難處。"},{"w":"restore","p":"v.","d":"to make something as good as it was before","c":"恢復；修復","s":"It took the workers two years to restore the old temple after the fire.","t":"火災後，工人們花了兩年修復那座老廟。"},{"w":"rub","p":"v.","d":"to press and move your hand or a cloth over a surface","c":"摩擦；揉搓","s":"It was so cold that we had to rub our hands together to keep warm.","t":"天氣冷到我們必須搓手取暖。"},{"w":"senses","p":"n.","d":"the five powers of sight, hearing, smell, taste, and touch","c":"感官；感覺","s":"Dogs have sharp senses and can smell things that people cannot.","t":"狗的感官很敏銳，能聞到人聞不到的東西。"},{"w":"veterinarian","p":"n.","d":"a doctor who takes care of sick or hurt animals","c":"獸醫","s":"We took our sick rabbit to the veterinarian, who gave it some medicine.","t":"我們帶生病的兔子去看獸醫，獸醫給牠開了藥。"}]},{"unit":8,"theme":"anniversary – upwards","cards":[{"w":"anniversary","p":"n.","d":"a date on which you remember something that happened in an earlier year","c":"週年紀念日","s":"My parents will celebrate their twentieth wedding anniversary next month.","t":"我父母下個月將慶祝結婚二十週年紀念日。"},{"w":"arithmetic","p":"n.","d":"the part of math that deals with adding, subtracting, multiplying, and dividing","c":"算術","s":"Young children learn simple arithmetic, such as two plus three, in first grade.","t":"小朋友在一年級學習簡單的算術，例如二加三。"},{"w":"ashamed","p":"adj.","d":"feeling bad or guilty about something you did","c":"羞愧的；慚愧的","s":"He felt ashamed of himself for lying to his best friend.","t":"他為自己對最好的朋友說謊感到羞愧。"},{"w":"burst","p":"v.","d":"to break open suddenly","c":"爆發；爆裂","s":"If you blow too much air into the balloon, it will burst with a loud bang.","t":"如果你把氣球吹得太滿，它會砰的一聲爆掉。"},{"w":"carpenter","p":"n.","d":"a person who makes or repairs wooden things","c":"木匠","s":"The carpenter built a strong wooden table and four chairs for our kitchen.","t":"木匠為我們的廚房做了一張堅固的木桌和四把椅子。"},{"w":"coal","p":"n.","d":"a hard black rock that is burned to produce heat","c":"煤炭","s":"In the past, trains burned coal to make the steam that moved them.","t":"從前火車燃燒煤炭來產生推動它們的蒸汽。"},{"w":"couch","p":"n.","d":"a long, soft seat for two or more people","c":"沙發","s":"After work, Dad lay down on the couch and fell asleep in front of the TV.","t":"下班後，爸爸躺在沙發上，在電視機前睡著了。"},{"w":"drip","p":"v.","d":"to fall in small drops","c":"滴下","s":"Water began to drip from the ceiling during the heavy rain.","t":"大雨期間，水開始從天花板滴下來。"},{"w":"elegant","p":"adj.","d":"beautiful and graceful in a simple way","c":"優雅的；高雅的","s":"She looked elegant in a long black dress and a pearl necklace.","t":"她穿著黑色長禮服、戴著珍珠項鍊，看起來很優雅。"},{"w":"fabric","p":"n.","d":"cloth used for making clothes, curtains, and other things","c":"布料；織物","s":"This shirt is made of a soft fabric that feels cool in summer.","t":"這件襯衫是用一種夏天穿起來很涼爽的柔軟布料做的。"},{"w":"highlands","p":"n.","d":"an area of land with many mountains","c":"高地","s":"Sheep farmers live in the cold highlands in the north of the country.","t":"牧羊的農民住在該國北部寒冷的高地。"},{"w":"ivory","p":"n.","d":"the hard, white material that elephants' tusks are made of","c":"象牙","s":"Many countries have banned the sale of ivory to protect elephants.","t":"許多國家已禁止販售象牙以保護大象。"},{"w":"mill","p":"n.","d":"a building with machines for grinding grain into flour","c":"磨坊；工廠","s":"The farmer took his wheat to the mill to have it made into flour.","t":"農夫把小麥帶到磨坊磨成麵粉。"},{"w":"needle","p":"n.","d":"a thin, sharp piece of metal used for sewing","c":"針","s":"Grandma used a needle and thread to fix the hole in my sock.","t":"奶奶用針線補我襪子上的破洞。"},{"w":"polish","p":"v.","d":"to rub something to make it shine","c":"擦亮；磨光","s":"He likes to polish his black leather shoes until he can see his face in them.","t":"他喜歡把黑皮鞋擦到能照出自己的臉。"},{"w":"sew","p":"v.","d":"to join pieces of cloth using a needle and thread","c":"縫紉","s":"My mother taught me how to sew a button onto a shirt.","t":"媽媽教我怎麼把鈕扣縫到襯衫上。"},{"w":"shed","p":"n.","d":"a small, simple building used for keeping tools or animals","c":"棚子；小屋","s":"Dad keeps his garden tools and the lawn mower in a shed behind the house.","t":"爸爸把園藝工具和割草機放在屋後的棚子裡。"},{"w":"thread","p":"n.","d":"a long, thin string used for sewing","c":"線","s":"I need some blue thread to sew this button back onto my jeans.","t":"我需要一些藍色的線把這顆鈕扣縫回牛仔褲上。"},{"w":"trim","p":"v.","d":"to cut a small amount off something to make it neat","c":"修剪","s":"I asked the barber to trim my hair a little, not to cut it short.","t":"我請理髮師把我的頭髮稍微修一下，不要剪短。"},{"w":"upwards","p":"adv.","d":"toward a higher place or position","c":"向上地","s":"The children watched the balloon float upwards until it disappeared into the clouds.","t":"孩子們看著氣球向上飄，直到消失在雲裡。"}]},{"unit":9,"theme":"ally – wrestle","cards":[{"w":"ally","p":"n.","d":"a person or country that helps and supports another","c":"盟友；支持者","s":"During the war, Britain was a close ally of the United States.","t":"戰爭期間，英國是美國親密的盟友。"},{"w":"boast","p":"v.","d":"to talk too proudly about what you have or what you have done","c":"吹噓；自誇","s":"He likes to boast about how much money his father makes.","t":"他喜歡吹噓他爸爸賺多少錢。"},{"w":"bounce","p":"v.","d":"to hit a surface and move quickly away from it","c":"彈起；反彈","s":"The children love to bounce the ball against the wall and catch it.","t":"孩子們喜歡把球往牆上彈再接住。"},{"w":"bully","p":"n.","d":"a person who hurts or frightens weaker people","c":"惡霸；欺凌者","s":"The school bully took the younger boy's lunch money every day.","t":"學校的惡霸每天搶走那個小男孩的午餐錢。"},{"w":"carbohydrate","p":"n.","d":"a substance in foods such as bread and rice that gives the body energy","c":"碳水化合物","s":"Rice is a carbohydrate that gives runners the energy they need for a long race.","t":"米飯是一種碳水化合物，能提供跑者長跑所需的能量。"},{"w":"crawl","p":"v.","d":"to move on your hands and knees","c":"爬行","s":"Most babies learn to crawl before they learn to walk.","t":"大多數嬰兒先學會爬才學會走路。"},{"w":"defeat","p":"v.","d":"to win against someone in a game or a fight","c":"擊敗；戰勝","s":"Our team trained hard to defeat last year's champions in the final.","t":"我們的隊伍努力訓練，要在決賽擊敗去年的冠軍。"},{"w":"dial","p":"n.","d":"the round front part of a clock or watch that shows the time","c":"錶盤；刻度盤","s":"The dial of my watch glows in the dark, so I can read the time at night.","t":"我手錶的錶盤在黑暗中會發光，所以我晚上也能看時間。"},{"w":"dominant","p":"adj.","d":"more powerful or important than others","c":"佔優勢的；支配的","s":"The company is the dominant computer maker and sells more than all the others together.","t":"這家公司是佔主導地位的電腦製造商，銷量比其他所有公司加起來還多。"},{"w":"entire","p":"adj.","d":"whole; with nothing left out","c":"整個的；全部的","s":"He was so hungry that he ate the entire pizza by himself.","t":"他餓到一個人吃掉整個披薩。"},{"w":"mercy","p":"n.","d":"kindness shown to someone you have the power to punish","c":"仁慈；寬恕","s":"The prisoner fell on his knees and begged the king for mercy.","t":"囚犯跪下來乞求國王的寬恕。"},{"w":"nod","p":"v.","d":"to move your head up and down to show that you agree","c":"點頭","s":"If you understand what I am saying, please nod your head.","t":"如果你聽懂我說的話，請點點頭。"},{"w":"opponent","p":"n.","d":"a person you play or fight against","c":"對手；敵手","s":"The boxer knocked down his opponent in the second round and won the match.","t":"拳擊手在第二回合擊倒對手，贏得比賽。"},{"w":"quarrel","p":"v.","d":"to argue angrily with someone","c":"爭吵；吵架","s":"The two brothers often quarrel about who gets to use the computer first.","t":"兩兄弟常常為了誰先用電腦而爭吵。"},{"w":"rival","p":"n.","d":"a person or group that competes with another","c":"競爭對手","s":"The two schools have been each other's biggest rival in basketball for years.","t":"多年來這兩所學校一直是彼此在籃球上最大的競爭對手。"},{"w":"sore","p":"adj.","d":"painful, especially from a wound or too much use","c":"痠痛的；疼痛的","s":"My legs were sore for three days after I ran the long race.","t":"跑完長跑後，我的腿痠痛了三天。"},{"w":"sting","p":"v.","d":"(of an insect or plant) to hurt you by pushing something sharp into your skin","c":"叮；刺","s":"Don't touch that bee, or it will sting you on the hand.","t":"別碰那隻蜜蜂，不然牠會螫你的手。"},{"w":"strain","p":"v.","d":"to try very hard to do something, using all your strength","c":"使勁；盡力","s":"The old man had to strain to hear what the quiet girl was saying.","t":"老人必須很費力才能聽見那個文靜女孩說的話。"},{"w":"torture","p":"n.","d":"something that causes great pain to the body or mind","c":"折磨；酷刑","s":"Waiting two weeks for the test results was pure torture for the students.","t":"等兩週才知道考試結果，對學生來說簡直是折磨。"},{"w":"wrestle","p":"v.","d":"to fight by holding someone and trying to push them to the ground","c":"摔角；扭打","s":"The two boys like to wrestle on the grass to see who is stronger.","t":"那兩個男孩喜歡在草地上摔角，看誰比較強壯。"}]},{"unit":10,"theme":"absence – wrinkle","cards":[{"w":"absence","p":"n.","d":"the state of not being in a place","c":"缺席；不在","s":"The teacher noticed his absence and called his parents to ask if he was sick.","t":"老師注意到他缺席，打電話問他父母他是否生病了。"},{"w":"aloud","p":"adv.","d":"in a voice that other people can hear","c":"大聲地","s":"The teacher asked me to read the poem aloud to the whole class.","t":"老師要我把這首詩大聲唸給全班聽。"},{"w":"bald","p":"adj.","d":"having little or no hair on the head","c":"禿頭的","s":"My uncle is bald, so he always wears a hat in the sun.","t":"我叔叔禿頭，所以他在太陽下總是戴帽子。"},{"w":"blanket","p":"n.","d":"a large, warm cover used on a bed","c":"毯子","s":"It was cold at night, so I asked for an extra blanket for my bed.","t":"晚上很冷，所以我多要了一條毯子蓋。"},{"w":"creep","p":"v.","d":"to move slowly and quietly so that no one notices","c":"爬行；悄悄移動","s":"The cat began to creep toward the bird without making a sound.","t":"那隻貓開始無聲無息地悄悄接近那隻鳥。"},{"w":"divorce","p":"n.","d":"the legal end of a marriage","c":"離婚","s":"After ten years of unhappy marriage, the couple decided to get a divorce.","t":"經過十年不幸福的婚姻，這對夫妻決定離婚。"},{"w":"imitate","p":"v.","d":"to copy the way someone speaks or behaves","c":"模仿","s":"Parrots can imitate human speech and repeat the words they hear.","t":"鸚鵡能模仿人說話，重複牠們聽到的字。"},{"w":"infant","p":"n.","d":"a very young baby","c":"嬰兒","s":"The mother held the sleeping infant in her arms and sang softly.","t":"母親把熟睡的嬰兒抱在懷裡，輕聲唱歌。"},{"w":"kidnap","p":"v.","d":"to take someone away by force, usually to get money","c":"綁架","s":"The criminals planned to kidnap the rich man's son and ask for a million dollars.","t":"歹徒計畫綁架富翁的兒子並勒索一百萬美元。"},{"w":"nap","p":"n.","d":"a short sleep during the day","c":"小睡；午覺","s":"Grandpa takes a nap on the sofa every afternoon after lunch.","t":"爺爺每天午餐後都在沙發上小睡一下。"},{"w":"nowhere","p":"adv.","d":"not in or to any place","c":"無處；到處都沒有","s":"I looked all over the house, but my keys were nowhere to be found.","t":"我找遍整間屋子，但哪裡都找不到我的鑰匙。"},{"w":"pat","p":"v.","d":"to touch someone or something gently several times with your hand","c":"輕拍","s":"The little girl bent down to pat the friendly dog on the head.","t":"小女孩彎下腰輕拍那隻友善的狗的頭。"},{"w":"relief","p":"n.","d":"the happy feeling you have when something bad ends or does not happen","c":"寬慰；解脫","s":"It was a great relief to hear that everyone on the plane was safe.","t":"聽到飛機上每個人都平安，真是讓人大大鬆了一口氣。"},{"w":"reproduce","p":"v.","d":"to make a copy of something","c":"複製；重現","s":"The artist tried to reproduce the famous painting, but his copy was not as good.","t":"那位藝術家試圖複製那幅名畫，但他的仿作沒有那麼好。"},{"w":"rhyme","p":"n.","d":"a word that ends with the same sound as another word","c":"押韻；童謠","s":"\"Cat\" is a rhyme for \"hat,\" and \"sun\" is one for \"fun.\"","t":"「cat」和「hat」押韻，「sun」和「fun」也押韻。"},{"w":"suck","p":"v.","d":"to pull liquid or air into your mouth","c":"吸吮","s":"Babies suck milk from a bottle when they are hungry.","t":"嬰兒肚子餓時會從奶瓶吸奶。"},{"w":"urgent","p":"adj.","d":"needing attention right away","c":"緊急的；急迫的","s":"This letter is urgent; please send it by the fastest way today.","t":"這封信很緊急，請今天就用最快的方式寄出。"},{"w":"vanish","p":"v.","d":"to disappear suddenly","c":"消失；突然不見","s":"The magician made the rabbit vanish from the box in front of our eyes.","t":"魔術師在我們眼前把兔子從箱子裡變不見了。"},{"w":"wagon","p":"n.","d":"a strong cart with four wheels, pulled by horses","c":"四輪馬車；推車","s":"Two horses pulled the heavy wagon full of hay to the farm.","t":"兩匹馬把裝滿乾草的沉重馬車拉到農場。"},{"w":"wrinkle","p":"n.","d":"a small line or fold in the skin or in cloth","c":"皺紋","s":"Grandma smiled, and a deep wrinkle appeared at the corner of each eye.","t":"奶奶笑了，兩邊眼角各出現一道深深的皺紋。"}]},{"unit":11,"theme":"architecture – welcome","cards":[{"w":"architecture","p":"n.","d":"the style and design of buildings; the work of designing them","c":"建築學；建築風格","s":"The city is famous for its old architecture, with stone churches and tall towers.","t":"這座城市以古老的建築聞名，有石造教堂和高塔。"},{"w":"basket","p":"n.","d":"a container made of thin sticks, used for carrying things","c":"籃子","s":"She carried the apples home from the farm in a basket.","t":"她用籃子把蘋果從農場提回家。"},{"w":"bloom","p":"v.","d":"(of a plant) to produce flowers","c":"開花","s":"The cherry trees in the park bloom for only two weeks every spring.","t":"公園裡的櫻花樹每年春天只開花兩週。"},{"w":"canoe","p":"n.","d":"a long, narrow, light boat that you move with a paddle","c":"獨木舟","s":"We paddled a canoe slowly down the quiet river.","t":"我們划著獨木舟在平靜的河上緩緩前進。"},{"w":"carpet","p":"n.","d":"a thick, soft cover for a floor","c":"地毯","s":"The baby likes to crawl on the soft carpet in the living room.","t":"寶寶喜歡在客廳柔軟的地毯上爬。"},{"w":"cousin","p":"n.","d":"a child of your aunt or uncle","c":"堂(表)兄弟姊妹","s":"My cousin Amy is the daughter of my mother's sister.","t":"我的表妹艾美是我阿姨的女兒。"},{"w":"desk","p":"n.","d":"a table where you sit to write, study, or work","c":"書桌；辦公桌","s":"The student sat at her desk and opened her textbook.","t":"那位學生坐在書桌前，打開課本。"},{"w":"gallery","p":"n.","d":"a room or building where people can look at art","c":"畫廊；美術館","s":"The gallery is showing paintings by young artists from Taiwan this month.","t":"這間畫廊本月展出台灣年輕藝術家的畫作。"},{"w":"guest","p":"n.","d":"a person who is invited to your home or to a party","c":"客人；賓客","s":"We cleaned the house because an important guest was coming for dinner.","t":"我們打掃了房子，因為有位重要的客人要來吃晚餐。"},{"w":"host","p":"n.","d":"a person who invites guests and takes care of them","c":"主人；東道主","s":"The host of the party welcomed everyone at the door with a drink.","t":"派對的主人在門口拿著飲料歡迎每個人。"},{"w":"July","p":"n.","d":"the seventh month of the year","c":"七月","s":"In Taiwan, the summer vacation begins in July and ends in August.","t":"在台灣，暑假從七月開始，八月結束。"},{"w":"modern","p":"adj.","d":"of the present time; using new ideas or styles","c":"現代的","s":"The old factory was turned into a modern office building with glass walls.","t":"那座舊工廠被改建成有玻璃牆的現代辦公大樓。"},{"w":"museum","p":"n.","d":"a building where people can see important old or interesting things","c":"博物館","s":"We saw dinosaur bones and ancient tools at the history museum.","t":"我們在歷史博物館看到恐龍骨頭和古代工具。"},{"w":"pink","p":"adj.","d":"having a color between red and white","c":"粉紅色(的)","s":"The little girl wore a pink dress, the color of a light rose.","t":"小女孩穿著一件淡玫瑰色的粉紅洋裝。"},{"w":"plane","p":"n.","d":"a flying vehicle with wings and engines","c":"飛機","s":"Our plane took off at nine and landed in Tokyo three hours later.","t":"我們的飛機九點起飛，三小時後降落東京。"},{"w":"refrigerator","p":"n.","d":"a machine that keeps food and drinks cold","c":"冰箱","s":"Put the milk back in the refrigerator, or it will go bad.","t":"把牛奶放回冰箱，不然會壞掉。"},{"w":"temperature","p":"n.","d":"how hot or cold something is","c":"溫度","s":"The temperature dropped to five degrees last night, so we turned on the heater.","t":"昨晚氣溫降到五度，所以我們開了暖氣。"},{"w":"theater","p":"n.","d":"a building where people watch plays or movies","c":"戲院；劇院","s":"We bought tickets to see a play at the theater on Saturday night.","t":"我們買了票，週六晚上要去劇院看戲。"},{"w":"upper","p":"adj.","d":"in a higher position than something else","c":"上面的；較高的","s":"The bedrooms are on the upper floor, and the kitchen is downstairs.","t":"臥室在樓上，廚房在樓下。"},{"w":"welcome","p":"v.","d":"to greet someone in a friendly way when they arrive","c":"歡迎","s":"The whole family stood at the door to welcome the visitors from Japan.","t":"全家人站在門口歡迎來自日本的訪客。"}]},{"unit":12,"theme":"anticipate – triumph","cards":[{"w":"anticipate","p":"v.","d":"to think that something will probably happen","c":"預期；期待","s":"We anticipate heavy traffic on the holiday, so we will leave very early.","t":"我們預期假日會塞車，所以會很早出發。"},{"w":"barrel","p":"n.","d":"a large round container for liquids such as oil or wine","c":"桶子","s":"The farmer stores rainwater in a big wooden barrel beside his house.","t":"農夫把雨水儲存在屋旁的大木桶裡。"},{"w":"beam","p":"n.","d":"a long, heavy piece of wood or metal that supports a roof","c":"樑；橫樑","s":"A thick wooden beam holds up the roof of the old farmhouse.","t":"一根粗木樑支撐著老農舍的屋頂。"},{"w":"casual","p":"adj.","d":"relaxed and not formal","c":"休閒的；隨便的","s":"You can wear casual clothes like jeans and a T-shirt to the party.","t":"你可以穿牛仔褲和T恤這類休閒服去參加派對。"},{"w":"caution","p":"n.","d":"great care taken to avoid danger","c":"謹慎；小心","s":"Please drive with caution on icy roads in winter.","t":"冬天在結冰的路上請小心駕駛。"},{"w":"contrary","p":"adj.","d":"completely different or opposite","c":"相反的；對立的","s":"The two scientists hold contrary views, so they never agree on anything.","t":"這兩位科學家持相反的看法，所以從來沒有意見一致過。"},{"w":"deliberate","p":"adj.","d":"done on purpose, not by accident","c":"故意的；蓄意的","s":"The fire was not an accident; it was a deliberate act by an angry worker.","t":"那場火不是意外，而是一名憤怒員工的蓄意行為。"},{"w":"dissolve","p":"v.","d":"to mix with a liquid and become part of it","c":"溶解","s":"Stir the tea until the sugar begins to dissolve in the hot water.","t":"攪拌茶，直到糖開始溶解在熱水裡。"},{"w":"explode","p":"v.","d":"to burst suddenly with a loud noise","c":"爆炸","s":"The police moved everyone away before the bomb could explode.","t":"警方在炸彈爆炸前把所有人疏散。"},{"w":"fasten","p":"v.","d":"to close or join two parts of something firmly","c":"繫緊；固定","s":"Please fasten your seat belt before the plane takes off.","t":"飛機起飛前請繫好安全帶。"},{"w":"germ","p":"n.","d":"a very small living thing that can make you sick","c":"細菌；病菌","s":"Wash your hands with soap, because one germ can make you ill.","t":"用肥皂洗手，因為一個病菌就可能讓你生病。"},{"w":"kit","p":"n.","d":"a set of tools or things that you need for a special purpose","c":"成套工具；裝備","s":"Every car should carry a first-aid kit with bandages and medicine.","t":"每輛車都應該放一個裝有繃帶和藥品的急救箱。"},{"w":"puff","p":"n.","d":"a small amount of smoke, wind, or air","c":"一陣 (煙；氣)","s":"A puff of smoke came out of the chimney and floated into the sky.","t":"一陣煙從煙囪冒出來，飄向天空。"},{"w":"rag","p":"n.","d":"a small piece of old cloth used for cleaning","c":"抹布；破布","s":"He wiped the oil off his hands with an old rag.","t":"他用一塊舊抹布把手上的油擦掉。"},{"w":"scatter","p":"v.","d":"to throw or drop things over a wide area","c":"散播；撒","s":"The farmer began to scatter seeds over the field by hand.","t":"農夫開始用手把種子撒在田裡。"},{"w":"scent","p":"n.","d":"a pleasant smell","c":"香味；氣味","s":"The scent of fresh roses filled the whole room.","t":"新鮮玫瑰的香味充滿整個房間。"},{"w":"steel","p":"n.","d":"a very strong metal made from iron","c":"鋼鐵","s":"The bridge is built of steel, so it can carry thousands of heavy trucks.","t":"這座橋是用鋼建造的，所以能承載數千輛重型卡車。"},{"w":"swift","p":"adj.","d":"moving or happening very quickly","c":"迅速的；敏捷的","s":"With one swift movement, the cat caught the mouse.","t":"那隻貓一個迅速的動作就抓住了老鼠。"},{"w":"toss","p":"v.","d":"to throw something lightly","c":"拋；擲","s":"Please toss me the keys; I can catch them from here.","t":"請把鑰匙丟給我，我從這裡接得到。"},{"w":"triumph","p":"n.","d":"a great success or victory","c":"勝利；巨大成功","s":"Winning the gold medal was the greatest triumph of her life.","t":"贏得金牌是她一生中最大的勝利。"}]},{"unit":13,"theme":"aboard – worship","cards":[{"w":"aboard","p":"prep.","d":"on or onto a ship, plane, bus, or train","c":"在(船；飛機；車)上","s":"All the passengers were aboard the ship when it left the harbor.","t":"船離港時，所有乘客都已在船上。"},{"w":"bitter","p":"adj.","d":"feeling angry and unhappy for a long time; having a sharp taste","c":"苦悶的；憤怒的；苦的","s":"He is still bitter about losing his job three years ago.","t":"他對三年前失業一事至今仍憤憤不平。"},{"w":"bullet","p":"n.","d":"a small piece of metal that is shot from a gun","c":"子彈","s":"The doctor removed a bullet from the soldier's leg.","t":"醫生從士兵的腿裡取出一顆子彈。"},{"w":"devil","p":"n.","d":"a powerful evil spirit","c":"魔鬼；惡魔","s":"In the old story, a man sold his soul to the devil for money.","t":"在那個古老的故事裡，有個人為了錢把靈魂賣給魔鬼。"},{"w":"drift","p":"v.","d":"to be carried slowly by wind or water","c":"漂流；漂移","s":"We turned off the engine and let the boat drift down the river.","t":"我們關掉引擎，讓船順流漂下。"},{"w":"enforce","p":"v.","d":"to make people obey a law or rule","c":"執行；強制","s":"The job of the police is to enforce the law and keep people safe.","t":"警察的工作是執行法律並保護人民安全。"},{"w":"fountain","p":"n.","d":"a structure that sends water up into the air","c":"噴泉","s":"Children were playing in the water of the fountain in the middle of the park.","t":"孩子們在公園中央噴泉的水裡玩耍。"},{"w":"harbor","p":"n.","d":"a safe area of water where ships can stay","c":"港口","s":"Dozens of fishing boats returned to the harbor before the storm arrived.","t":"數十艘漁船在暴風雨來臨前回到港口。"},{"w":"inhabit","p":"v.","d":"to live in a place","c":"居住於；棲息","s":"Polar bears inhabit the cold lands around the North Pole.","t":"北極熊棲息在北極周圍的寒冷土地上。"},{"w":"march","p":"v.","d":"to walk with regular steps like a soldier","c":"行軍；齊步走","s":"The soldiers march through the city center on National Day every year.","t":"士兵們每年國慶日都在市中心行進。"},{"w":"millionaire","p":"n.","d":"a person who has a million dollars or more","c":"百萬富翁","s":"He became a millionaire at thirty after selling his computer company.","t":"他賣掉電腦公司後，三十歲就成了百萬富翁。"},{"w":"port","p":"n.","d":"a town or city where ships arrive and leave","c":"港口；口岸","s":"Kaohsiung is the largest port in Taiwan, and ships from all over the world stop there.","t":"高雄是台灣最大的港口，世界各地的船都在那裡停靠。"},{"w":"sheriff","p":"n.","d":"the chief police officer of an area in the United States","c":"警長","s":"The sheriff of the small town caught the bank robbers by himself.","t":"小鎮的警長獨自抓到銀行搶匪。"},{"w":"startle","p":"v.","d":"to surprise or frighten someone suddenly","c":"使驚嚇","s":"Don't walk up behind me so quietly; you always startle me.","t":"別那麼安靜地走到我背後，你總是嚇到我。"},{"w":"sweat","p":"v.","d":"to lose water through your skin because you are hot or nervous","c":"流汗","s":"I always sweat a lot when I run in the summer heat.","t":"夏天在高溫下跑步時，我總是流很多汗。"},{"w":"trigger","p":"n.","d":"the part of a gun that you pull to fire it","c":"板機；觸發器","s":"The hunter aimed carefully at the target and pulled the trigger.","t":"獵人仔細瞄準目標，然後扣下扳機。"},{"w":"unify","p":"v.","d":"to join people or parts together to make one","c":"統一；聯合","s":"The new leader hopes to unify the country after years of fighting.","t":"新領導人希望在多年爭戰後統一國家。"},{"w":"vessel","p":"n.","d":"a large ship or boat","c":"船艦；血管","s":"The huge vessel can carry more than five thousand cars across the ocean.","t":"這艘巨大的船艦能載運五千多輛車橫越海洋。"},{"w":"voyage","p":"n.","d":"a long journey by ship or in space","c":"航行；旅程","s":"The voyage from England to America took two months in those days.","t":"在那個年代，從英國到美國的航程要花兩個月。"},{"w":"worship","p":"v.","d":"to show great respect and love for a god","c":"崇拜；敬仰","s":"People come to this temple to worship the goddess of the sea.","t":"人們來這座廟敬拜海上女神。"}]},{"unit":14,"theme":"apprentice – scold","cards":[{"w":"apprentice","p":"n.","d":"a young person who works for a skilled person in order to learn a job","c":"學徒","s":"The baker's apprentice gets up at four every morning to learn how to make bread.","t":"麵包師的學徒每天早上四點起床學做麵包。"},{"w":"assure","p":"v.","d":"to tell someone that something is certainly true","c":"向...保證；確保","s":"I assure you that the dog is friendly and will not bite.","t":"我向你保證這隻狗很友善，不會咬人。"},{"w":"bandage","p":"n.","d":"a long piece of cloth that is wrapped around a wound","c":"繃帶","s":"The nurse cleaned the cut and wrapped a bandage around his arm.","t":"護士清理了傷口，並在他手臂上包紮繃帶。"},{"w":"bleed","p":"v.","d":"to lose blood from a cut","c":"流血","s":"Press hard on the cut, or it will continue to bleed.","t":"用力壓住傷口，不然會繼續流血。"},{"w":"bond","p":"v.","d":"to develop a close relationship with someone","c":"建立關係；結合","s":"Reading stories together helps parents bond with their children.","t":"一起讀故事有助於父母和孩子建立親密關係。"},{"w":"chef","p":"n.","d":"a professional cook, especially the head cook in a restaurant","c":"主廚；廚師","s":"The chef at this hotel has cooked for presidents and movie stars.","t":"這家飯店的主廚曾為總統和電影明星做過菜。"},{"w":"crown","p":"n.","d":"a circle of gold and jewels that a king or queen wears on the head","c":"皇冠","s":"The queen wore a golden crown with a hundred diamonds on it.","t":"女王戴著一頂鑲有一百顆鑽石的金色皇冠。"},{"w":"departure","p":"n.","d":"the act of leaving a place","c":"出發；離開","s":"Our departure was delayed for two hours because of the thick fog.","t":"由於濃霧，我們的出發時間延後了兩小時。"},{"w":"diligent","p":"adj.","d":"working hard and carefully","c":"勤奮的；勤勉的","s":"The diligent student reviews her notes every night and never misses homework.","t":"那位勤奮的學生每晚複習筆記，從不缺交作業。"},{"w":"emperor","p":"n.","d":"the man who rules a group of countries","c":"皇帝","s":"The Chinese emperor lived in a huge palace called the Forbidden City.","t":"中國的皇帝住在一座叫紫禁城的巨大宮殿裡。"},{"w":"fiber","p":"n.","d":"the part of plants in food that helps your body digest; a thin thread","c":"纖維","s":"Vegetables and fruit are rich in fiber, which keeps your stomach healthy.","t":"蔬菜和水果富含纖維，能讓你的腸胃保持健康。"},{"w":"horrible","p":"adj.","d":"very bad or unpleasant","c":"可怕的；極糟的","s":"The milk had gone bad and had a horrible smell.","t":"牛奶壞了，有一股可怕的味道。"},{"w":"impolite","p":"adj.","d":"not polite; rude","c":"不禮貌的","s":"It is impolite to talk loudly on your phone in a library.","t":"在圖書館大聲講電話是不禮貌的。"},{"w":"kneel","p":"v.","d":"to go down on your knees","c":"跪下","s":"In some churches, people kneel on the floor when they pray.","t":"在某些教堂裡，人們禱告時會跪在地上。"},{"w":"luxury","p":"n.","d":"something expensive that you enjoy but do not really need","c":"奢侈(品)","s":"A private swimming pool is a luxury that most families cannot afford.","t":"私人游泳池是大多數家庭負擔不起的奢侈品。"},{"w":"massive","p":"adj.","d":"very large and heavy","c":"巨大的","s":"A massive rock fell from the mountain and blocked the whole road.","t":"一塊巨大的岩石從山上落下，擋住了整條路。"},{"w":"panic","p":"v.","d":"to suddenly feel so afraid that you cannot think clearly","c":"恐慌","s":"If there is a fire, do not panic; walk calmly to the nearest exit.","t":"如果發生火災，不要恐慌，冷靜地走向最近的出口。"},{"w":"priority","p":"n.","d":"the thing that is most important and must be done first","c":"優先考慮的事","s":"The safety of the children is our first priority on every school trip.","t":"每次校外教學，孩子的安全都是我們的第一優先。"},{"w":"robe","p":"n.","d":"a long, loose piece of clothing","c":"長袍；浴袍","s":"After his bath, he put on a soft white robe and sat by the fire.","t":"洗完澡後，他穿上柔軟的白色浴袍，坐在火爐旁。"},{"w":"scold","p":"v.","d":"to speak angrily to someone because they did something wrong","c":"責罵","s":"Parents often scold their children for staying up too late.","t":"父母常因孩子熬夜而責罵他們。"}]},{"unit":15,"theme":"affair – theft","cards":[{"w":"affair","p":"n.","d":"an event or a matter that people talk about or deal with","c":"事務；事件","s":"The wedding was a small family affair with only twenty guests.","t":"那場婚禮是只有二十位賓客的小型家庭聚會。"},{"w":"assembly","p":"n.","d":"a meeting of a large group of people for a special purpose","c":"集會；大會","s":"The principal spoke to all the students at the morning assembly in the gym.","t":"校長在體育館的朝會上對全體學生講話。"},{"w":"bless","p":"v.","d":"to ask God to protect someone or something","c":"祝福；賜福","s":"The priest raised his hand to bless the newly married couple.","t":"神父舉起手為這對新婚夫婦祝福。"},{"w":"cereal","p":"n.","d":"a breakfast food made from grain, usually eaten with milk","c":"穀片；麥片","s":"I eat a bowl of cereal with cold milk every morning.","t":"我每天早上吃一碗加冰牛奶的麥片。"},{"w":"cheerful","p":"adj.","d":"happy and showing it","c":"興高采烈的；愉快的","s":"The nurse's cheerful smile made all the sick children feel better.","t":"護士愉快的笑容讓所有生病的孩子感覺好多了。"},{"w":"diameter","p":"n.","d":"a straight line across a circle through its center","c":"直徑","s":"The round table is two meters in diameter, so ten people can sit at it.","t":"這張圓桌直徑兩公尺，可以坐十個人。"},{"w":"exploit","p":"v.","d":"to treat someone unfairly in order to get money or an advantage","c":"剝削；利用","s":"Some factory owners exploit poor workers by paying them very little.","t":"有些工廠老闆用極低的工資剝削貧窮的工人。"},{"w":"famine","p":"n.","d":"a time when many people have very little food and may die","c":"饑荒","s":"Millions of people died in the famine when no rain fell for three years.","t":"三年沒下雨，數百萬人死於那場饑荒。"},{"w":"harvest","p":"n.","d":"the time when crops are gathered; the crops that are gathered","c":"收穫；收成","s":"Farmers are very busy during the rice harvest in autumn.","t":"秋天稻米收成期間，農民非常忙碌。"},{"w":"merry","p":"adj.","d":"happy and full of fun","c":"歡樂的；愉快的","s":"We wish you a merry Christmas and a happy New Year!","t":"祝你聖誕快樂、新年快樂！"},{"w":"nut","p":"n.","d":"a dry fruit with a hard shell and a seed inside that you can eat","c":"堅果","s":"The squirrel cracked the nut open with its sharp teeth.","t":"松鼠用銳利的牙齒把堅果咬開。"},{"w":"pardon","p":"v.","d":"to forgive someone for something","c":"原諒；寬恕","s":"Please pardon me for stepping on your foot; I did not see you.","t":"請原諒我踩到你的腳，我沒看到你。"},{"w":"pharaoh","p":"n.","d":"a king of ancient Egypt","c":"法老","s":"The pharaoh ordered thousands of workers to build a pyramid for his tomb.","t":"法老下令數千名工人為他建造金字塔作為陵墓。"},{"w":"ripe","p":"adj.","d":"(of fruit) fully grown and ready to eat","c":"成熟的","s":"Don't eat the green bananas; wait until they are ripe and yellow.","t":"別吃青香蕉，等它們成熟變黃再吃。"},{"w":"roast","p":"v.","d":"to cook food in an oven or over a fire","c":"烘烤","s":"We will roast a whole chicken in the oven for dinner tonight.","t":"我們今晚要用烤箱烤一整隻雞當晚餐。"},{"w":"routine","p":"n.","d":"the usual way and order in which you do things","c":"慣例；常規","s":"Brushing my teeth and reading are part of my bedtime routine.","t":"刷牙和閱讀是我睡前例行事務的一部分。"},{"w":"scheme","p":"n.","d":"a clever plan, often a secret or dishonest one","c":"計畫；陰謀","s":"The two men thought of a scheme to steal money from the bank.","t":"那兩個人想出一個從銀行偷錢的陰謀。"},{"w":"slim","p":"adj.","d":"thin in an attractive way","c":"苗條的；微薄的","s":"She stays slim by swimming every morning and eating healthy food.","t":"她靠每天早上游泳和吃健康的食物保持苗條。"},{"w":"stove","p":"n.","d":"a piece of kitchen equipment used for cooking","c":"爐子","s":"Mom put a pot of soup on the stove and turned on the gas.","t":"媽媽把一鍋湯放在爐子上，然後開瓦斯。"},{"w":"theft","p":"n.","d":"the crime of stealing something","c":"偷竊；盜竊","s":"He reported the theft of his bicycle to the police.","t":"他向警方報案說他的腳踏車被偷了。"}]},{"unit":16,"theme":"adolescent – tidy","cards":[{"w":"adolescent","p":"n.","d":"a young person who is growing from a child into an adult","c":"青少年","s":"Every adolescent wants more freedom, but parents still worry about them.","t":"每個青少年都想要更多自由，但父母仍然擔心他們。"},{"w":"aptitude","p":"n.","d":"a natural ability to do something well","c":"天資；才能","s":"She showed an aptitude for music at the age of four, when she first played the piano.","t":"她四歲第一次彈鋼琴時就展現出音樂天分。"},{"w":"compliment","p":"v.","d":"to say something nice about someone","c":"讚美；恭維","s":"Guests often compliment my mother on her delicious cooking.","t":"客人常常稱讚我媽媽做的菜好吃。"},{"w":"hinder","p":"v.","d":"to make it difficult for someone to do something","c":"阻礙；妨礙","s":"Heavy snow will hinder the rescue team from reaching the village.","t":"大雪會阻礙救援隊抵達村莊。"},{"w":"journalism","p":"n.","d":"the work of collecting and writing news","c":"新聞業","s":"She studied journalism in college and now writes for a newspaper.","t":"她大學主修新聞學，現在為報社寫稿。"},{"w":"jury","p":"n.","d":"a group of ordinary people who decide in court if someone is guilty","c":"陪審團","s":"The jury of twelve people decided that the man was not guilty.","t":"由十二人組成的陪審團認定那名男子無罪。"},{"w":"justice","p":"n.","d":"fair treatment under the law","c":"正義；公平","s":"The family of the dead man asked the court for justice.","t":"死者的家屬請求法院主持正義。"},{"w":"liberty","p":"n.","d":"the freedom to live as you choose","c":"自由","s":"The people fought for their liberty and finally became a free nation.","t":"人民為自由而戰，最後成為一個自由的國家。"},{"w":"literary","p":"adj.","d":"connected with books and writing of high quality","c":"文學的","s":"She won a literary prize for her first novel.","t":"她的第一本小說贏得了文學獎。"},{"w":"pharmacy","p":"n.","d":"a store where medicine is prepared and sold","c":"藥局；藥房","s":"I went to the pharmacy to buy some medicine for my headache.","t":"我去藥局買頭痛藥。"},{"w":"pill","p":"n.","d":"a small, round piece of medicine that you swallow","c":"藥丸","s":"The doctor told him to take one pill after each meal.","t":"醫生叫他每餐飯後吃一顆藥丸。"},{"w":"presume","p":"v.","d":"to think that something is true without being sure","c":"假定；推測","s":"Her coat is gone, so I presume she has already left the office.","t":"她的外套不見了，所以我推測她已經離開辦公室。"},{"w":"privacy","p":"n.","d":"the state of being alone and not watched by others","c":"隱私","s":"Please knock before you come in; teenagers need their privacy.","t":"進來前請先敲門，青少年需要隱私。"},{"w":"punishment","p":"n.","d":"something bad that is done to someone because they did something wrong","c":"懲罰","s":"As a punishment for breaking the window, he had to clean the classroom for a week.","t":"作為打破窗戶的懲罰，他必須打掃教室一週。"},{"w":"sensible","p":"adj.","d":"showing good judgment; reasonable","c":"明智的；講理的","s":"It is sensible to save some money every month for the future.","t":"每個月為將來存點錢是明智的。"},{"w":"slice","p":"n.","d":"a thin, flat piece cut from something","c":"薄片；一片","s":"Would you like a slice of lemon in your tea?","t":"你的茶裡要加一片檸檬嗎？"},{"w":"sorrow","p":"n.","d":"a feeling of great sadness","c":"悲傷；哀痛","s":"Her eyes were full of sorrow when she spoke about her dead husband.","t":"她談到過世的丈夫時，眼裡充滿悲傷。"},{"w":"straw","p":"n.","d":"a thin tube used for drinking","c":"吸管","s":"The child drank her juice through a straw.","t":"那個孩子用吸管喝果汁。"},{"w":"swell","p":"v.","d":"to become larger than normal","c":"腫脹；膨脹","s":"If a bee stings your hand, your fingers may swell and turn red.","t":"如果蜜蜂螫了你的手，你的手指可能會腫起來變紅。"},{"w":"tidy","p":"adj.","d":"neat and in order","c":"整潔的","s":"She keeps her desk tidy, with every pen and book in its place.","t":"她把書桌保持整潔，每支筆和每本書都放在固定位置。"}]},{"unit":17,"theme":"affection – wander","cards":[{"w":"affection","p":"n.","d":"a feeling of liking or loving someone","c":"喜愛；感情","s":"The old man looked at his grandchildren with great affection.","t":"老人滿懷慈愛地看著他的孫子們。"},{"w":"agency","p":"n.","d":"a business that provides a service for other people or companies","c":"代理機構；代辦處","s":"We booked our flight and hotel through a travel agency.","t":"我們透過旅行社訂了機票和飯店。"},{"w":"ash","p":"n.","d":"the gray powder that is left after something has burned","c":"灰燼","s":"After the fire, only a pile of gray ash was left of the wooden house.","t":"火災後，那棟木屋只剩下一堆灰燼。"},{"w":"confine","p":"v.","d":"to keep someone or something inside a small space","c":"限制；禁閉","s":"The doctor told her to confine herself to bed until the fever was gone.","t":"醫生叫她臥床休息，直到退燒為止。"},{"w":"dismiss","p":"v.","d":"to decide that an idea is not important enough to think about","c":"摒棄；不理會","s":"Don't dismiss his idea so quickly; it may be better than you think.","t":"別那麼快否定他的想法，它可能比你想的好。"},{"w":"erupt","p":"v.","d":"(of a volcano) to explode and throw out fire and hot rock","c":"(火山) 爆發","s":"Scientists warned that the volcano could erupt at any time.","t":"科學家警告那座火山隨時可能爆發。"},{"w":"fate","p":"n.","d":"a power that some people believe controls what happens","c":"命運","s":"She believed that fate had brought her and her husband together.","t":"她相信是命運把她和丈夫帶到一起。"},{"w":"lava","p":"n.","d":"hot liquid rock that comes out of a volcano","c":"熔岩","s":"Red-hot lava flowed down the side of the volcano and burned the trees.","t":"熾熱的熔岩沿著火山側面流下，燒毀了樹木。"},{"w":"miserable","p":"adj.","d":"very unhappy or uncomfortable","c":"悲慘的；痛苦的","s":"I felt miserable lying in bed with a fever and a sore throat.","t":"我發燒又喉嚨痛地躺在床上，覺得很痛苦。"},{"w":"navigate","p":"v.","d":"to find the way to a place, especially by using a map","c":"航行；導航","s":"Sailors once used the stars to navigate across the ocean.","t":"水手曾經利用星星在海上導航。"},{"w":"originate","p":"v.","d":"to begin to exist in a certain place or way","c":"發源；起源","s":"Many popular sports, such as soccer and tennis, originate in England.","t":"許多受歡迎的運動，例如足球和網球，起源於英國。"},{"w":"remainder","p":"n.","d":"the part of something that is left","c":"剩餘物；餘下部分","s":"He ate two pieces of cake and saved the remainder for his sister.","t":"他吃了兩塊蛋糕，把剩下的留給妹妹。"},{"w":"retrieve","p":"v.","d":"to get something back from a place","c":"取回；尋回","s":"The dog jumped into the lake to retrieve the ball.","t":"那隻狗跳進湖裡把球撿回來。"},{"w":"shallow","p":"adj.","d":"not deep","c":"淺的","s":"The water is shallow here, so small children can play safely.","t":"這裡的水很淺，所以小孩可以安全地玩。"},{"w":"slope","p":"n.","d":"the side of a hill or mountain","c":"斜坡","s":"The children rolled down the grassy slope and laughed.","t":"孩子們滾下長滿草的斜坡，哈哈大笑。"},{"w":"span","p":"v.","d":"to stretch across a period of time or a space","c":"跨越；橫跨","s":"Her career as a teacher will span forty years when she retires next June.","t":"到明年六月退休時，她的教師生涯將橫跨四十年。"},{"w":"superstition","p":"n.","d":"a belief that some things bring good or bad luck","c":"迷信","s":"It is a superstition that breaking a mirror brings seven years of bad luck.","t":"打破鏡子會帶來七年厄運是一種迷信。"},{"w":"sympathy","p":"n.","d":"a feeling of being sorry for someone who has a problem","c":"同情心","s":"I have great sympathy for the families who lost their homes in the flood.","t":"我非常同情在水災中失去家園的家庭。"},{"w":"vibrate","p":"v.","d":"to shake with small, fast movements","c":"震動","s":"I set my phone to vibrate instead of ring during the meeting.","t":"開會時我把手機設成震動而不是響鈴。"},{"w":"wander","p":"v.","d":"to walk around slowly without a clear purpose","c":"漫遊；徘徊","s":"We had no plan, so we decided to wander around the old town.","t":"我們沒有計畫，所以決定在老城區閒逛。"}]},{"unit":18,"theme":"armor – yield","cards":[{"w":"armor","p":"n.","d":"metal clothing that soldiers wore long ago to protect their bodies","c":"盔甲","s":"The knight put on his heavy metal armor before the battle.","t":"騎士在戰鬥前穿上沉重的金屬盔甲。"},{"w":"blaze","p":"v.","d":"to burn strongly and brightly","c":"熊熊燃燒","s":"The firefighters could only watch the forest blaze through the night.","t":"消防員只能眼睜睜看著森林徹夜熊熊燃燒。"},{"w":"boom","p":"v.","d":"to make a loud, deep sound","c":"發出轟隆聲","s":"We heard the big guns boom in the distance during the storm of battle.","t":"在激烈的戰鬥中，我們聽到遠處大砲轟隆作響。"},{"w":"cliff","p":"n.","d":"a high, steep wall of rock, often at the edge of the sea","c":"懸崖","s":"Stay away from the edge of the cliff; it is a long way down to the sea.","t":"離懸崖邊遠一點，下面到海很深。"},{"w":"flame","p":"n.","d":"the hot, bright gas that you see when something burns","c":"火焰","s":"The flame of the candle moved gently in the wind.","t":"蠟燭的火焰在風中輕輕搖曳。"},{"w":"independence","p":"n.","d":"freedom from control by another country or person","c":"獨立","s":"The United States won its independence from Britain in 1783.","t":"美國在1783年脫離英國贏得獨立。"},{"w":"invasion","p":"n.","d":"the act of an army entering another country by force","c":"入侵","s":"The people prepared to defend their land against the enemy invasion.","t":"人民準備保衛國土，抵抗敵人的入侵。"},{"w":"knight","p":"n.","d":"a soldier of high rank in the past who fought on a horse","c":"騎士","s":"In the story, a brave knight rides out to save the princess from the dragon.","t":"故事中，一位勇敢的騎士騎馬去從龍的手中救出公主。"},{"w":"lightning","p":"n.","d":"a bright flash of light in the sky during a storm","c":"閃電","s":"A flash of lightning lit up the dark sky before the thunder came.","t":"雷聲來臨前，一道閃電照亮了黑暗的天空。"},{"w":"rebel","p":"n.","d":"a person who fights against the people in power","c":"叛亂者；反抗者","s":"The rebel and his followers fought against the king's army.","t":"那名叛亂者和他的追隨者對抗國王的軍隊。"},{"w":"retreat","p":"v.","d":"to move back to get away from danger or an enemy","c":"撤退","s":"The army had to retreat when it ran out of food and bullets.","t":"軍隊在糧食和子彈耗盡時不得不撤退。"},{"w":"revolution","p":"n.","d":"a time when people change their government by force","c":"革命","s":"The French revolution of 1789 ended the rule of the king.","t":"1789年的法國大革命結束了國王的統治。"},{"w":"spear","p":"n.","d":"a long stick with a sharp point, used as a weapon","c":"長矛","s":"The hunter threw his spear at the wild pig.","t":"獵人把長矛擲向野豬。"},{"w":"steep","p":"adj.","d":"rising or falling very sharply","c":"陡峭的","s":"The hill was so steep that we had to push our bikes to the top.","t":"山坡陡到我們必須把腳踏車推上去。"},{"w":"summit","p":"n.","d":"the top of a mountain","c":"頂峰","s":"After eight hours of climbing, they finally reached the summit of the mountain.","t":"爬了八小時後，他們終於抵達山頂。"},{"w":"thunder","p":"n.","d":"the loud noise that follows lightning in a storm","c":"雷聲","s":"The dog hid under the bed when it heard the loud thunder.","t":"那隻狗聽到響亮的雷聲時躲到床底下。"},{"w":"troops","p":"n.","d":"soldiers in large groups","c":"軍隊；部隊","s":"The president sent troops to help the people after the earthquake.","t":"地震後總統派遣軍隊去幫助人民。"},{"w":"warrior","p":"n.","d":"a brave and skilled fighter or soldier","c":"戰士","s":"The old warrior had fought in more than fifty battles.","t":"那位老戰士打過五十多場仗。"},{"w":"withdraw","p":"v.","d":"to move back or away from a place; to stop taking part","c":"撤退；退出","s":"The general ordered his men to withdraw from the city before nightfall.","t":"將軍命令部下在天黑前撤出城市。"},{"w":"yield","p":"v.","d":"to stop fighting and accept defeat; to give way","c":"屈服；讓出","s":"The brave soldiers refused to yield even when they were surrounded.","t":"那些勇敢的士兵即使被包圍也拒絕投降。"}]},{"unit":19,"theme":"bench – tender","cards":[{"w":"bench","p":"n.","d":"a long seat for two or more people, usually outdoors","c":"長椅","s":"The old couple sat on a park bench and fed the birds.","t":"那對老夫婦坐在公園長椅上餵鳥。"},{"w":"daisy","p":"n.","d":"a small flower with white petals and a yellow center","c":"雛菊","s":"The little girl picked a daisy and put it in her hair.","t":"小女孩摘了一朵雛菊插在頭髮上。"},{"w":"dispute","p":"n.","d":"a serious argument or disagreement","c":"爭論；糾紛","s":"The two neighbors had a dispute over who owned the old apple tree.","t":"兩位鄰居為了那棵老蘋果樹歸誰而起了爭執。"},{"w":"empty","p":"adj.","d":"having nothing or nobody inside","c":"空的","s":"The classroom was empty because all the students had gone home.","t":"教室是空的，因為所有學生都回家了。"},{"w":"horror","p":"n.","d":"a strong feeling of fear and shock","c":"恐懼","s":"She screamed in horror when she saw a snake in her bed.","t":"她看到床上有一條蛇時，嚇得尖叫。"},{"w":"incident","p":"n.","d":"an event, especially one that is unusual or unpleasant","c":"事件","s":"The police are asking people about a shooting incident near the station last night.","t":"警方正在詢問民眾昨晚車站附近的槍擊事件。"},{"w":"mist","p":"n.","d":"a thin cloud of very small drops of water in the air","c":"薄霧","s":"The mountains were hidden in the morning mist.","t":"群山隱沒在晨霧中。"},{"w":"object","p":"n.","d":"a thing that you can see and touch","c":"物體；物品","s":"A strange shiny object was lying on the beach.","t":"沙灘上躺著一個奇怪又發亮的物體。"},{"w":"orphan","p":"n.","d":"a child whose parents are both dead","c":"孤兒","s":"The orphan was raised by her aunt after the car accident.","t":"車禍之後，那個孤兒由她阿姨撫養長大。"},{"w":"plot","p":"v.","d":"to make a secret plan to do something bad","c":"密謀","s":"The prisoners began to plot their escape from the island.","t":"囚犯們開始密謀逃離那座島。"},{"w":"pregnant","p":"adj.","d":"having a baby growing inside the body","c":"懷孕的","s":"She is six months pregnant and will have the baby in May.","t":"她懷孕六個月，五月會生產。"},{"w":"rage","p":"n.","d":"very strong anger","c":"憤怒；狂暴","s":"He was shaking with rage when he saw the damage to his new car.","t":"看到新車受損，他氣得發抖。"},{"w":"revenge","p":"n.","d":"something you do to hurt someone because they hurt you","c":"報復","s":"The prince wanted revenge on the man who had killed his father.","t":"王子想向殺死他父親的人報仇。"},{"w":"shame","p":"n.","d":"a bad feeling you have when you have done something wrong","c":"羞恥；慚愧","s":"His face turned red with shame when the teacher caught him cheating.","t":"被老師抓到作弊時，他羞愧得臉都紅了。"},{"w":"sigh","p":"v.","d":"to let out a long, deep breath because you are sad or tired","c":"嘆氣","s":"Whenever she thinks of her lost dog, she will sigh and look out the window.","t":"每當想起走失的狗，她就會嘆氣並望向窗外。"},{"w":"sneak","p":"v.","d":"to move somewhere quietly and secretly","c":"偷偷地走","s":"The boy tried to sneak out of the house without waking his parents.","t":"男孩試圖在不吵醒父母的情況下偷偷溜出家門。"},{"w":"spare","p":"v.","d":"to give time or money to someone","c":"撥出；騰出","s":"Can you spare a few minutes to help me with this math problem?","t":"你能撥出幾分鐘幫我解這題數學嗎？"},{"w":"stem","p":"n.","d":"the long, thin part of a plant that holds up the leaves and flowers","c":"莖","s":"She cut the stem of each rose before putting the flowers in a vase.","t":"她把每朵玫瑰的莖剪短，再把花插進花瓶。"},{"w":"supper","p":"n.","d":"a meal eaten in the evening","c":"晚餐","s":"The family sat down to supper at seven and talked about their day.","t":"全家人七點坐下來吃晚餐，聊聊各自的一天。"},{"w":"tender","p":"adj.","d":"(of food) soft and easy to cut or chew","c":"柔軟的；嫩的","s":"Cook the beef slowly for three hours until it is tender.","t":"把牛肉慢燉三小時，直到肉變得軟嫩。"}]},{"unit":20,"theme":"beneath – vital","cards":[{"w":"beneath","p":"prep.","d":"under or below something","c":"在...之下","s":"The treasure was hidden beneath the floor of the old house.","t":"寶藏藏在老房子的地板底下。"},{"w":"cub","p":"n.","d":"a baby bear, lion, or tiger","c":"幼獸 (如熊、獅等)","s":"The mother bear never leaves her cub alone in the forest.","t":"母熊從不把她的幼熊獨自留在森林裡。"},{"w":"dawn","p":"n.","d":"the time of day when the sun first appears","c":"黎明；破曉","s":"The farmers get up at dawn and start working before the sun is high.","t":"農民在黎明時起床，太陽升高前就開始工作。"},{"w":"dissatisfied","p":"adj.","d":"not happy with something","c":"不滿意的","s":"The customers were dissatisfied with the slow service and never came back.","t":"顧客對緩慢的服務感到不滿，再也沒回來過。"},{"w":"ease","p":"n.","d":"the state of being able to do something without difficulty","c":"容易；輕鬆","s":"She is so good at math that she passed the test with ease.","t":"她數學很好，輕鬆就通過了考試。"},{"w":"evident","p":"adj.","d":"easy to see or understand; clear","c":"明顯的；明白的","s":"It was evident from her red eyes that she had been crying.","t":"從她紅紅的眼睛明顯看得出她哭過。"},{"w":"hail","p":"n.","d":"small, hard balls of ice that fall from the sky like rain","c":"冰雹","s":"The hail was as big as golf balls and broke many car windows.","t":"冰雹大得像高爾夫球，打破了許多車窗。"},{"w":"howl","p":"v.","d":"(of a dog or wolf) to make a long, loud cry","c":"嚎叫","s":"We heard the wolves howl at the moon in the middle of the night.","t":"半夜我們聽到狼群對著月亮嚎叫。"},{"w":"leap","p":"v.","d":"to jump high or a long way","c":"跳躍","s":"The dancer can leap into the air like a bird.","t":"那位舞者能像鳥一樣躍入空中。"},{"w":"magnificent","p":"adj.","d":"very beautiful, large, or impressive","c":"壯麗的；宏偉的","s":"From the top of the tower, we had a magnificent view of the whole city.","t":"從塔頂我們能看到整座城市的壯麗景色。"},{"w":"necessity","p":"n.","d":"something that you must have in order to live","c":"必需品","s":"Clean water is a necessity of life, not a luxury.","t":"乾淨的水是生活必需品，不是奢侈品。"},{"w":"outcome","p":"n.","d":"the final result of something","c":"結果；後果","s":"Nobody can be sure of the outcome of the election until all the votes are counted.","t":"在所有選票計算完之前，沒有人能確定選舉的結果。"},{"w":"pile","p":"n.","d":"a number of things lying on top of each other","c":"一堆","s":"There is a pile of dirty clothes on the floor of his room.","t":"他房間的地板上有一堆髒衣服。"},{"w":"profound","p":"adj.","d":"very deep and strongly felt","c":"深奧的；深刻的","s":"His mother's death had a profound effect on the rest of his life.","t":"母親的去世對他往後的人生有深遠的影響。"},{"w":"seize","p":"v.","d":"to take hold of something quickly and with force","c":"抓住；奪取","s":"The police officer moved fast to seize the thief by the arm.","t":"警察迅速出手抓住小偷的手臂。"},{"w":"squeeze","p":"v.","d":"to press something hard from both sides","c":"擠壓；緊抱","s":"You need to squeeze three lemons to make a glass of juice.","t":"你需要擠三顆檸檬才能做一杯果汁。"},{"w":"supreme","p":"adj.","d":"highest in rank or importance","c":"至高的；最高的","s":"In those days, the king held supreme power, and nobody could question his orders.","t":"在那個年代，國王握有至高的權力，沒有人能質疑他的命令。"},{"w":"terrific","p":"adj.","d":"very good; excellent","c":"極好的","s":"You did a terrific job on your science project; everyone loved it.","t":"你的科學作業做得太棒了，大家都很喜歡。"},{"w":"trait","p":"n.","d":"a quality that is part of someone's character","c":"特徵；特點","s":"Honesty is the trait I admire most in my best friend.","t":"誠實是我最欣賞我好朋友的特質。"},{"w":"vital","p":"adj.","d":"very important; necessary for life","c":"攸關生命的；極重要的","s":"It is vital to drink enough water when you exercise in hot weather.","t":"在炎熱的天氣運動時，喝足夠的水極為重要。"}]},{"unit":21,"theme":"attack – sugar","cards":[{"w":"attack","p":"v.","d":"to try to hurt or damage someone or something","c":"攻擊","s":"Some viruses attack the body's cells and make people very sick.","t":"有些病毒會攻擊人體細胞，讓人病得很重。"},{"w":"breast","p":"n.","d":"one of the two soft parts on a woman's chest that produce milk","c":"乳房","s":"A mother's breast produces milk to feed her newborn baby.","t":"母親的乳房會分泌乳汁哺育新生兒。"},{"w":"cancer","p":"n.","d":"a serious disease in which cells in the body grow in a way that is not normal","c":"癌症","s":"Smoking can cause lung cancer, a disease that kills millions every year.","t":"吸菸會導致肺癌，這種疾病每年奪走數百萬人的生命。"},{"w":"cancerous","p":"adj.","d":"having or caused by cancer","c":"癌的；癌細胞的","s":"The doctors removed the cancerous cells before the disease could spread.","t":"醫生在疾病擴散前切除了癌細胞。"},{"w":"cell","p":"n.","d":"the smallest living part of a plant or animal","c":"細胞","s":"Every cell in your body is too small to see without a microscope.","t":"你體內的每個細胞都小到不用顯微鏡就看不見。"},{"w":"cigarette","p":"n.","d":"a thin paper tube filled with tobacco that people smoke","c":"香煙","s":"He put out his cigarette before entering the hospital.","t":"他進醫院前把香菸熄掉。"},{"w":"code","p":"n.","d":"a system of letters, numbers, or signs that carries information or a secret message","c":"密碼；代碼","s":"The spy wrote the message in a secret code that only his boss could read.","t":"間諜用只有他上司看得懂的密碼寫下訊息。"},{"w":"cure","p":"n.","d":"something that makes a sick person healthy again","c":"治療；解藥","s":"Scientists are still looking for a cure for the common cold.","t":"科學家仍在尋找治療普通感冒的方法。"},{"w":"destruction","p":"n.","d":"the act of damaging something so badly that it no longer exists","c":"破壞；毀滅","s":"The earthquake caused the destruction of thousands of homes.","t":"地震造成數千棟房屋毀壞。"},{"w":"DNA","p":"n.","d":"the material in every living cell that carries information passed from parents","c":"去氧核糖核酸 (DNA)","s":"The police used DNA from a hair to find out who the thief was.","t":"警方利用一根頭髮上的DNA查出小偷是誰。"},{"w":"extensive","p":"adj.","d":"covering a large area; great in amount","c":"廣泛的；大規模的","s":"The flood caused extensive damage to farms across the whole region.","t":"洪水對整個地區的農場造成大範圍的損害。"},{"w":"female","p":"adj.","d":"belonging to the sex that can give birth or lay eggs","c":"女性的；雌性的","s":"A female lion does most of the hunting for the family.","t":"母獅負責家族大部分的獵食工作。"},{"w":"furthermore","p":"adv.","d":"in addition to what has been said","c":"此外；而且","s":"The house is too small for us; furthermore, it is far from my office.","t":"這棟房子對我們來說太小；此外，它離我的辦公室很遠。"},{"w":"gene","p":"n.","d":"a part of a cell that controls what a living thing is like, passed on from parents","c":"基因","s":"The gene for blue eyes can be passed from parents to children.","t":"藍眼睛的基因可以由父母傳給孩子。"},{"w":"inherit","p":"v.","d":"to receive money, property, or a quality from your parents","c":"遺傳；繼承","s":"Children often inherit their eye color from their mother or father.","t":"孩子的眼睛顏色常常遺傳自母親或父親。"},{"w":"link","p":"n.","d":"a connection between two things","c":"連結；關聯","s":"Doctors have found a clear link between smoking and heart disease.","t":"醫生發現吸菸和心臟病之間有明確的關聯。"},{"w":"male","p":"adj.","d":"belonging to the sex that does not give birth","c":"男性的；雄性的","s":"A male peacock has a long, colorful tail, but the female does not.","t":"雄孔雀有長而鮮豔的尾巴，雌孔雀則沒有。"},{"w":"population","p":"n.","d":"the number of people who live in a place","c":"人口；群體","s":"The population of Taiwan is about twenty-three million.","t":"台灣的人口約兩千三百萬。"},{"w":"result","p":"n.","d":"something that happens because of something else","c":"結果","s":"The fire was the result of a cigarette that someone dropped on the sofa.","t":"那場火災是有人把香菸掉在沙發上造成的結果。"},{"w":"sugar","p":"n.","d":"a sweet substance used in food and drinks","c":"糖","s":"Too much sugar in drinks and snacks is bad for your teeth.","t":"飲料和零食裡太多糖對牙齒不好。"}]},{"unit":22,"theme":"accommodate – tempt","cards":[{"w":"accommodate","p":"v.","d":"to have enough room for a number of people","c":"容納；提供住宿","s":"The new hotel can accommodate five hundred guests at a time.","t":"這家新飯店一次可容納五百位客人。"},{"w":"circus","p":"n.","d":"a traveling show with clowns, acrobats, and trained animals","c":"馬戲團","s":"The children laughed at the clowns and cheered for the acrobats at the circus.","t":"孩子們在馬戲團裡被小丑逗笑，並為雜技演員喝采。"},{"w":"coincide","p":"v.","d":"to happen at the same time","c":"同時發生","s":"My birthday will coincide with the Moon Festival this year, so we will have two celebrations.","t":"今年我的生日和中秋節同一天，所以我們會有兩個慶祝活動。"},{"w":"commission","p":"v.","d":"to officially ask someone to make a work of art or do a piece of work","c":"委託","s":"The city decided to commission a famous artist to paint the wall of the station.","t":"市政府決定委託一位知名藝術家彩繪車站的牆面。"},{"w":"dose","p":"n.","d":"an amount of medicine that you take at one time","c":"(藥物的) 劑量","s":"Take one dose of this medicine every six hours.","t":"每六小時服用一劑這種藥。"},{"w":"dye","p":"v.","d":"to change the color of hair or cloth","c":"染色","s":"My grandmother wants to dye her gray hair black.","t":"我奶奶想把她的白髮染黑。"},{"w":"extent","p":"n.","d":"how large or serious something is","c":"程度；範圍","s":"Nobody knew the full extent of the damage until the water went down.","t":"直到水退了，才有人知道損害的全部程度。"},{"w":"gender","p":"n.","d":"the fact of being male or female","c":"性別","s":"People should be paid the same for the same work, whatever their gender.","t":"不論性別，同工就應該同酬。"},{"w":"headline","p":"n.","d":"the title of a newspaper story, printed in large letters","c":"標題；頭條","s":"The headline on the front page read \"Local Team Wins World Cup.\"","t":"頭版標題寫著「本地球隊贏得世界盃」。"},{"w":"informal","p":"adj.","d":"relaxed and friendly; not following strict rules","c":"非正式的","s":"It was an informal meeting, so nobody wore a suit or a tie.","t":"那是一場非正式的會議，所以沒有人穿西裝打領帶。"},{"w":"inquire","p":"v.","d":"to ask for information","c":"詢問；調查","s":"I called the station to inquire about the time of the last train.","t":"我打電話到車站詢問末班車的時間。"},{"w":"messenger","p":"n.","d":"a person who carries a message from one person to another","c":"使者；信差","s":"The king sent a messenger on a fast horse to carry the news to the army.","t":"國王派一名信差騎快馬把消息送給軍隊。"},{"w":"peer","p":"v.","d":"to look very carefully because something is hard to see","c":"凝視；端詳","s":"She had to peer through the fog to read the road sign.","t":"她必須在霧中仔細看才能看清路標。"},{"w":"portrait","p":"n.","d":"a painting or photograph of a person","c":"肖像；畫像","s":"A portrait of the queen hangs on the wall of the great hall.","t":"大廳的牆上掛著一幅女王的肖像。"},{"w":"pose","p":"v.","d":"to sit or stand in a certain position for a photo or painting","c":"擺姿勢","s":"The bride and groom will pose for photos in front of the church.","t":"新娘和新郎會在教堂前擺姿勢拍照。"},{"w":"ranch","p":"n.","d":"a very large farm where cattle or horses are kept","c":"牧場","s":"The cowboy keeps two thousand cattle on his ranch in Texas.","t":"那位牛仔在德州的牧場養了兩千頭牛。"},{"w":"steer","p":"v.","d":"to control the direction of a car, boat, or bicycle","c":"駕駛；操縱","s":"It is hard to steer a bicycle with only one hand.","t":"只用一隻手很難控制腳踏車的方向。"},{"w":"stripe","p":"n.","d":"a long, narrow line of color","c":"條紋","s":"A zebra has one black stripe after another on its white body.","t":"斑馬的白色身體上有一條接一條的黑色條紋。"},{"w":"tame","p":"adj.","d":"(of an animal) not wild; not afraid of people","c":"溫馴的","s":"The deer in this park are so tame that they eat from visitors' hands.","t":"這座公園的鹿非常溫馴，會從遊客手中吃東西。"},{"w":"tempt","p":"v.","d":"to make someone want to do or have something, especially something bad","c":"引誘；誘惑","s":"The smell of fresh cake may tempt you to break your diet.","t":"新鮮蛋糕的香味可能會引誘你打破節食計畫。"}]},{"unit":23,"theme":"ban – wizard","cards":[{"w":"ban","p":"v.","d":"to say officially that something is not allowed","c":"禁止","s":"Many cities plan to ban smoking in all restaurants and parks.","t":"許多城市計畫禁止在所有餐廳和公園吸菸。"},{"w":"cautious","p":"adj.","d":"careful to avoid danger or mistakes","c":"謹慎的；小心的","s":"Be cautious when you cross this busy road with small children.","t":"帶小孩過這條繁忙的馬路時要小心。"},{"w":"confess","p":"v.","d":"to admit that you did something wrong","c":"坦白；承認","s":"After two hours of questions, the man decided to confess that he had stolen the money.","t":"被問了兩小時後，那名男子決定坦承偷了錢。"},{"w":"cottage","p":"n.","d":"a small house, usually in the country","c":"村舍；小屋","s":"My grandparents live in a pretty little cottage with a garden near the sea.","t":"我的祖父母住在海邊一間有花園的漂亮小屋裡。"},{"w":"daytime","p":"n.","d":"the time of day when it is light","c":"白天","s":"Owls sleep in the daytime and hunt for food at night.","t":"貓頭鷹白天睡覺，晚上獵食。"},{"w":"desperate","p":"adj.","d":"having little hope and ready to do anything to change a bad situation","c":"絕望的；拼命的","s":"The desperate man had not eaten for three days and begged for food.","t":"那個走投無路的男人三天沒吃東西，乞求食物。"},{"w":"exhausting","p":"adj.","d":"making you feel very tired","c":"令人筋疲力盡的","s":"Moving all the furniture to the new house was exhausting work.","t":"把所有家具搬到新家是令人筋疲力盡的工作。"},{"w":"fade","p":"v.","d":"to slowly lose color or brightness","c":"褪色；逐漸消失","s":"If you leave the photo in the sun, its colors will fade.","t":"如果你把照片放在太陽下，它的顏色會褪掉。"},{"w":"fierce","p":"adj.","d":"angry and ready to attack; very strong","c":"兇猛的；猛烈的","s":"A fierce dog guards the gate and barks at everyone who comes near.","t":"一隻兇猛的狗守在大門口，對每個靠近的人吠叫。"},{"w":"gamble","p":"v.","d":"to risk money on the result of a game or race","c":"賭博","s":"He lost his house because he liked to gamble on horse races.","t":"他因為喜歡賭馬而失去了房子。"},{"w":"lawn","p":"n.","d":"an area of short grass in a garden or park","c":"草坪；草地","s":"The children are playing football on the lawn in front of the house.","t":"孩子們正在屋前的草坪上踢足球。"},{"w":"mow","p":"v.","d":"to cut grass with a machine","c":"割 (草)","s":"My father likes to mow the grass in our yard every Saturday morning.","t":"我爸爸喜歡每週六早上修剪院子裡的草。"},{"w":"outlaw","p":"n.","d":"a criminal who is hiding from the police","c":"逃犯；歹徒","s":"The outlaw hid in the mountains for years to escape the sheriff.","t":"那名逃犯在山裡躲了好幾年以逃避警長的追捕。"},{"w":"prospect","p":"n.","d":"the possibility that something good will happen in the future","c":"展望；前景","s":"The prospect of a long summer vacation made the students smile.","t":"即將有漫長暑假的展望讓學生們露出笑容。"},{"w":"purse","p":"n.","d":"a small bag in which a woman carries money and personal things","c":"女用手提包；錢包","s":"She opened her purse and took out some coins to pay for the bus.","t":"她打開手提包，拿出一些硬幣付公車錢。"},{"w":"rod","p":"n.","d":"a long, thin, straight stick or bar","c":"竿；棍棒","s":"Grandpa took his fishing rod and a bucket to the river.","t":"爺爺帶著釣竿和水桶去河邊。"},{"w":"seldom","p":"adv.","d":"not often","c":"很少；不常","s":"My uncle lives abroad, so we seldom see him, maybe once every three years.","t":"我叔叔住在國外，所以我們很少見到他，大概三年一次。"},{"w":"shave","p":"v.","d":"to cut hair off the face or body with a razor","c":"刮鬍子","s":"My father has to shave every morning before he goes to work.","t":"我爸爸每天早上上班前都得刮鬍子。"},{"w":"terrified","p":"adj.","d":"very afraid","c":"極度恐懼的","s":"The little girl was terrified of the thunder and hid under her blanket.","t":"小女孩非常害怕雷聲，躲進毯子裡。"},{"w":"wizard","p":"n.","d":"a man in stories who has magic powers","c":"巫師；魔法師","s":"In the story, an old wizard with a long white beard turns a mouse into a horse.","t":"故事中，一位留著白色長鬍子的老巫師把老鼠變成一匹馬。"}]},{"unit":24,"theme":"abroad – volume","cards":[{"w":"abroad","p":"adv.","d":"in or to a foreign country","c":"在國外；到國外","s":"She plans to study abroad in Japan for one year after high school.","t":"她計畫高中畢業後到日本留學一年。"},{"w":"airline","p":"n.","d":"a company that carries people or goods by plane","c":"航空公司","s":"The airline canceled all its flights because of the typhoon.","t":"航空公司因颱風取消了所有航班。"},{"w":"audience","p":"n.","d":"the people who watch or listen to a show, a movie, or a speech","c":"觀眾；聽眾","s":"The audience stood up and clapped for five minutes after the concert.","t":"音樂會結束後，觀眾起立鼓掌五分鐘。"},{"w":"bargain","p":"n.","d":"something that is sold at a lower price than usual","c":"便宜貨；交易","s":"This coat was a real bargain; I paid only half the usual price.","t":"這件外套真是划算，我只付了原價的一半。"},{"w":"brief","p":"adj.","d":"lasting only a short time","c":"短暫的；簡短的","s":"The principal gave a brief speech of only three minutes.","t":"校長只發表了三分鐘的簡短演說。"},{"w":"currency","p":"n.","d":"the money that is used in a country","c":"貨幣","s":"The yen is the currency of Japan, and the dollar is used in the United States.","t":"日圓是日本的貨幣，美國則使用美元。"},{"w":"data","p":"n.","d":"facts or information, often in the form of numbers","c":"資料；數據","s":"The scientists collected data on rainfall for more than fifty years.","t":"科學家們收集了五十多年的降雨資料。"},{"w":"domestic","p":"adj.","d":"inside one country, not foreign; of the home","c":"國內的；家庭的","s":"The airline offers domestic flights between Taipei and Kaohsiung.","t":"這家航空公司提供台北和高雄之間的國內航班。"},{"w":"draft","p":"n.","d":"a piece of writing that is not yet in its final form","c":"草稿","s":"This is only the first draft of my essay; I will change it later.","t":"這只是我作文的初稿，之後還會修改。"},{"w":"gather","p":"v.","d":"to come together in a group; to collect things","c":"聚集；收集","s":"Crowds began to gather in the square to welcome the winning team.","t":"人群開始聚集在廣場上歡迎獲勝的隊伍。"},{"w":"hobby","p":"n.","d":"an activity that you enjoy doing in your free time","c":"嗜好","s":"Collecting stamps has been my hobby since I was eight years old.","t":"我從八歲起就以集郵為嗜好。"},{"w":"income","p":"n.","d":"the money that a person earns from work","c":"收入；所得","s":"Half of his monthly income goes to pay the rent on his apartment.","t":"他每月收入的一半用來付公寓的房租。"},{"w":"jet","p":"n.","d":"a very fast plane","c":"噴射機","s":"The president flew to the meeting in his private jet.","t":"總統搭乘私人噴射機飛去開會。"},{"w":"maximum","p":"adj.","d":"the largest that is allowed or possible","c":"最大值(的)；極大值","s":"The maximum speed on this road is fifty kilometers an hour.","t":"這條路的最高速限是時速五十公里。"},{"w":"official","p":"adj.","d":"approved by the government or by someone in power","c":"官方的；正式的","s":"The official language of Brazil is Portuguese, not Spanish.","t":"巴西的官方語言是葡萄牙語，不是西班牙語。"},{"w":"recommend","p":"v.","d":"to say that something is good and that someone should try it","c":"推薦；建議","s":"Can you recommend a good restaurant near the train station?","t":"你能推薦一家火車站附近的好餐廳嗎？"},{"w":"refer","p":"v.","d":"to mention or speak about someone or something","c":"提及；參考","s":"In his speech, the mayor did not refer to the problem of traffic at all.","t":"市長在演說中完全沒有提到交通問題。"},{"w":"remote","p":"adj.","d":"far away from places where other people live","c":"遙遠的；偏僻的","s":"They live in a remote village that has no roads or electricity.","t":"他們住在一個沒有道路也沒有電的偏遠村莊。"},{"w":"sleepless","p":"adj.","d":"without sleep","c":"失眠的；不眠的","s":"The new parents spent many sleepless nights taking care of their crying baby.","t":"這對新手父母度過了許多照顧哭鬧寶寶的不眠之夜。"},{"w":"volume","p":"n.","d":"the level of sound from a TV, radio, or speaker","c":"音量；體積；總量","s":"Please turn down the volume of the TV; the baby is sleeping.","t":"請把電視音量調小，寶寶在睡覺。"}]},{"unit":25,"theme":"circulate – via","cards":[{"w":"circulate","p":"v.","d":"to move around and around inside a system or area","c":"循環；流通","s":"The heart makes blood circulate through the whole body.","t":"心臟使血液在全身循環。"},{"w":"consequent","p":"adj.","d":"happening as a result of something","c":"隨之發生的；作為結果的","s":"The heavy rain and the consequent floods destroyed most of the crops.","t":"大雨和隨之而來的洪水毀掉了大部分農作物。"},{"w":"derive","p":"v.","d":"to get something from something else","c":"源自；取得","s":"Many English words derive from Latin and Greek.","t":"許多英文單字源自拉丁文和希臘文。"},{"w":"drown","p":"v.","d":"to die from being under water too long","c":"溺水；淹死","s":"A person who cannot swim may drown in deep water within minutes.","t":"不會游泳的人在深水中可能幾分鐘內就會溺斃。"},{"w":"dynasty","p":"n.","d":"a series of rulers who all come from the same family","c":"朝代；王朝","s":"The Ming dynasty ruled China for almost three hundred years.","t":"明朝統治中國將近三百年。"},{"w":"fraction","p":"n.","d":"a small part or amount of something","c":"小部分；分數","s":"Only a small fraction of the students, about three in a hundred, failed the test.","t":"只有一小部分的學生，大約百分之三，考試不及格。"},{"w":"frost","p":"n.","d":"a thin white layer of ice that forms on the ground when it is very cold","c":"霜","s":"The grass was white with frost on the cold winter morning.","t":"寒冷的冬晨，草地因結霜而一片白。"},{"w":"illusion","p":"n.","d":"something that seems real but is not","c":"幻覺；錯覺","s":"The water on the hot road was only an illusion; the road was dry.","t":"炎熱路面上的水只是錯覺，路面其實是乾的。"},{"w":"invade","p":"v.","d":"to enter another country by force with an army","c":"入侵；侵略","s":"The enemy army planned to invade the country from the north.","t":"敵軍計畫從北方入侵該國。"},{"w":"lieutenant","p":"n.","d":"an officer of low rank in the army or navy","c":"中尉；副官","s":"The young lieutenant led twenty soldiers across the river at night.","t":"那位年輕的中尉在夜裡帶領二十名士兵過河。"},{"w":"marine","p":"adj.","d":"connected with the sea and the animals that live in it","c":"海洋的；海事的","s":"Whales, sharks, and dolphins are all marine animals.","t":"鯨魚、鯊魚和海豚都是海洋動物。"},{"w":"merit","p":"n.","d":"a good quality that deserves praise","c":"優點；價值","s":"The great merit of this plan is that it costs very little money.","t":"這個計畫最大的優點是花費很少。"},{"w":"navy","p":"n.","d":"the part of a country's military that fights at sea","c":"海軍","s":"He joined the navy and spent five years working on a warship.","t":"他加入海軍，在一艘軍艦上服役了五年。"},{"w":"polar","p":"adj.","d":"connected with the North or South Pole","c":"極地的；兩極的","s":"Scientists study the polar ice to learn how fast the earth is warming.","t":"科學家研究極地的冰層，以了解地球暖化的速度。"},{"w":"ray","p":"n.","d":"a thin line of light","c":"光線","s":"A single ray of sunlight came through the hole in the roof.","t":"一道陽光從屋頂的破洞照進來。"},{"w":"resign","p":"v.","d":"to leave your job by your own choice","c":"辭職；放棄","s":"The minister had to resign after the newspaper reported his lies.","t":"報紙報導了那位部長的謊言後，他不得不辭職。"},{"w":"suicide","p":"n.","d":"the act of killing yourself","c":"自殺","s":"The teacher talked with the sad student for hours to prevent a suicide.","t":"老師和那位悲傷的學生談了好幾個小時，以防止自殺的發生。"},{"w":"tremble","p":"v.","d":"to shake because you are cold, afraid, or excited","c":"發抖；震顫","s":"The frightened puppy began to tremble when it heard the thunder.","t":"受驚的小狗聽到雷聲就開始發抖。"},{"w":"underlying","p":"adj.","d":"being the real but hidden cause of something","c":"潛在的；根本的","s":"Stress at work was the underlying cause of his headaches.","t":"工作壓力是他頭痛的根本原因。"},{"w":"via","p":"prep.","d":"by way of a place; by means of","c":"經由；透過","s":"We flew from Taipei to London via Hong Kong.","t":"我們從台北經香港飛往倫敦。"}]},{"unit":26,"theme":"alter – wire","cards":[{"w":"alter","p":"v.","d":"to change something","c":"改變","s":"The tailor can alter the dress to make it fit you better.","t":"裁縫可以修改這件洋裝，讓它更合身。"},{"w":"aside","p":"adv.","d":"to one side; out of the way","c":"到旁邊","s":"She stepped aside to let the old man pass.","t":"她站到一旁讓那位老人通過。"},{"w":"autumn","p":"n.","d":"the season between summer and winter","c":"秋天","s":"In autumn, the leaves turn red and yellow and fall from the trees.","t":"秋天時，樹葉變紅變黃並從樹上落下。"},{"w":"blend","p":"v.","d":"to mix two or more things together completely","c":"混合","s":"First blend the butter and sugar together, and then add the eggs.","t":"先把奶油和糖混合在一起，再加入雞蛋。"},{"w":"collapse","p":"v.","d":"to fall down suddenly","c":"倒塌","s":"The old bridge may collapse if a heavy truck drives over it.","t":"如果有重型卡車開過，那座舊橋可能會倒塌。"},{"w":"crush","p":"v.","d":"to press something so hard that it breaks or loses its shape","c":"壓碎","s":"Use the back of a spoon to crush the garlic before you cook it.","t":"煮之前先用湯匙背面把大蒜壓碎。"},{"w":"curve","p":"v.","d":"to bend or move in a line that is not straight","c":"彎曲","s":"The road begins to curve to the left just after the bridge.","t":"這條路一過橋就開始向左彎。"},{"w":"disgusting","p":"adj.","d":"very unpleasant and making you feel sick","c":"令人作嘔的","s":"The smell of the rotten fish was so disgusting that I had to leave the kitchen.","t":"腐爛的魚味道噁心到我不得不離開廚房。"},{"w":"drain","p":"n.","d":"a pipe or hole that carries away dirty water","c":"排水管","s":"Hair blocked the drain in the bathroom, so the water could not flow away.","t":"頭髮堵住了浴室的排水管，所以水流不掉。"},{"w":"embrace","p":"v.","d":"to hold someone closely in your arms to show love","c":"擁抱","s":"The mother ran to embrace her son when he came home from the war.","t":"兒子從戰場回家時，母親跑上前擁抱他。"},{"w":"envy","p":"v.","d":"to wish that you had what another person has","c":"羨慕；嫉妒","s":"I envy people who can sing well; my voice is terrible.","t":"我羨慕歌唱得好的人，我的歌聲很糟。"},{"w":"fireworks","p":"n.","d":"things that explode in the sky with bright colors and loud sounds","c":"煙火","s":"We watched the fireworks light up the night sky on New Year's Eve.","t":"除夕夜我們看著煙火照亮夜空。"},{"w":"flour","p":"n.","d":"a powder made from wheat, used to make bread and cakes","c":"麵粉","s":"You need flour, eggs, and butter to bake a cake.","t":"烤蛋糕需要麵粉、雞蛋和奶油。"},{"w":"fuse","p":"n.","d":"a string or small part that burns or melts to make something explode or to stop the electricity","c":"引信；導火線","s":"He lit the fuse of the firecracker and ran away quickly.","t":"他點燃鞭炮的引信，然後迅速跑開。"},{"w":"ginger","p":"n.","d":"a root with a hot, strong taste, used in cooking","c":"薑","s":"My mother puts a little ginger in the fish soup to make it taste better.","t":"我媽媽在魚湯裡放一點薑讓味道更好。"},{"w":"jealous","p":"adj.","d":"unhappy because someone has something that you want","c":"嫉妒的","s":"The little boy felt jealous when his parents gave all their attention to the new baby.","t":"父母把全部注意力放在新生兒身上時，小男孩感到嫉妒。"},{"w":"paste","p":"n.","d":"a soft, wet mixture that can be spread easily","c":"糊狀物；漿糊","s":"Mix the flour and water into a thick paste and spread it on the paper.","t":"把麵粉和水調成濃稠的糊，塗在紙上。"},{"w":"receipt","p":"n.","d":"a piece of paper that shows you have paid for something","c":"收據","s":"Keep the receipt in case you want to return the shoes to the store.","t":"把收據留著，以防你想把鞋子退回店裡。"},{"w":"wipe","p":"v.","d":"to clean or dry something by rubbing it with a cloth","c":"擦拭","s":"Please wipe the table with a wet cloth after dinner.","t":"晚餐後請用濕布擦桌子。"},{"w":"wire","p":"n.","d":"a long, thin piece of metal that carries electricity","c":"電線；金屬線","s":"Don't touch that wire; electricity is running through it.","t":"別碰那條電線，裡面有電流通過。"}]},{"unit":27,"theme":"acknowledge – vase","cards":[{"w":"acknowledge","p":"v.","d":"to accept or admit that something is true","c":"承認；認可","s":"He refused to acknowledge that he had made a mistake.","t":"他拒絕承認自己犯了錯。"},{"w":"ambassador","p":"n.","d":"an official who represents his or her country in another country","c":"大使","s":"The ambassador met the president to talk about trade between the two countries.","t":"大使會見總統，討論兩國之間的貿易。"},{"w":"blonde","p":"n.","d":"a person, especially a woman, with light yellow hair","c":"金髮的人","s":"The actress is a blonde in real life, but she wears a black wig in the movie.","t":"那位女演員現實生活中是金髮，但在電影裡戴黑色假髮。"},{"w":"conquer","p":"v.","d":"to take control of a country or people by force","c":"征服","s":"The king led his army to conquer all the lands to the east.","t":"國王率領軍隊去征服東邊所有的土地。"},{"w":"drag","p":"v.","d":"to pull something heavy along the ground","c":"拖；拉","s":"The box was too heavy to carry, so I had to drag it across the floor.","t":"箱子重得搬不動，所以我只好把它拖過地板。"},{"w":"exaggerate","p":"v.","d":"to make something seem bigger or better than it really is","c":"誇大","s":"Fishermen often exaggerate the size of the fish they caught.","t":"釣魚的人常常誇大自己釣到的魚的大小。"},{"w":"heritage","p":"n.","d":"the traditions, buildings, and culture that a country has had for a long time","c":"遺產；傳統","s":"The old temples are an important part of Taiwan's cultural heritage.","t":"這些古廟是台灣文化遺產的重要部分。"},{"w":"insult","p":"v.","d":"to say or do something rude that hurts someone","c":"侮辱","s":"I did not mean to insult the cook by leaving food on my plate.","t":"我把食物留在盤子上並不是有意侮辱廚師。"},{"w":"meanwhile","p":"adv.","d":"at the same time","c":"同時","s":"Mom cooked dinner; meanwhile, Dad set the table and fed the baby.","t":"媽媽煮晚餐；同時，爸爸擺好餐桌並餵寶寶。"},{"w":"necklace","p":"n.","d":"a piece of jewelry that you wear around your neck","c":"項鍊","s":"He gave his wife a gold necklace for her birthday.","t":"他送給妻子一條金項鍊作為生日禮物。"},{"w":"noble","p":"n.","d":"a person of the highest social class in a country with a king or queen","c":"貴族","s":"The rich noble owned a castle and thousands of acres of land.","t":"那位富有的貴族擁有一座城堡和數千英畝的土地。"},{"w":"precious","p":"adj.","d":"very valuable or important","c":"珍貴的","s":"Clean water is precious in the desert, so nobody wastes a drop.","t":"乾淨的水在沙漠中很珍貴，所以沒有人浪費一滴。"},{"w":"prejudice","p":"n.","d":"an unfair dislike of a group of people","c":"偏見","s":"Judging people by the color of their skin is a form of prejudice.","t":"以膚色評斷人是一種偏見。"},{"w":"rumor","p":"n.","d":"a story that people repeat but that may not be true","c":"謠言","s":"There is a rumor that our teacher is getting married, but nobody knows if it is true.","t":"有謠言說我們老師要結婚了，但沒人知道是不是真的。"},{"w":"sin","p":"n.","d":"an act that breaks a religious or moral law","c":"罪惡","s":"Many religions teach that stealing is a sin.","t":"許多宗教教導說偷竊是一種罪。"},{"w":"spectacle","p":"n.","d":"an unusual or impressive sight or show","c":"奇觀；壯觀","s":"The sunrise over the mountain was a spectacle that we will never forget.","t":"山上的日出是我們永遠忘不了的奇觀。"},{"w":"stack","p":"n.","d":"a neat pile of things","c":"堆；一疊","s":"There was a stack of books on the teacher's desk, one on top of another.","t":"老師的桌上有一疊書，一本疊著一本。"},{"w":"suspicious","p":"adj.","d":"making you feel that something is wrong or that someone is not honest","c":"可疑的；多疑的","s":"A suspicious man was looking into the parked cars, so I called the police.","t":"一名可疑男子正往停著的車裡張望，所以我報了警。"},{"w":"tin","p":"n.","d":"a soft, silver-colored metal","c":"錫","s":"The toy soldier was made of tin and painted red and blue.","t":"那個玩具兵是錫做的，漆成紅色和藍色。"},{"w":"vase","p":"n.","d":"a container for holding cut flowers","c":"花瓶","s":"She put the roses in a glass vase on the dining table.","t":"她把玫瑰插在餐桌上的玻璃花瓶裡。"}]},{"unit":28,"theme":"ache – tragedy","cards":[{"w":"ache","p":"v.","d":"to hurt with a pain that does not stop","c":"疼痛","s":"My legs always ache after I climb a high mountain.","t":"爬完高山後，我的腿總是會痠痛。"},{"w":"arctic","p":"adj.","d":"relating to the very cold area around the North Pole","c":"北極的","s":"Only a few animals can live through the long, dark arctic winter.","t":"只有少數動物能熬過漫長又黑暗的北極冬天。"},{"w":"canal","p":"n.","d":"a long passage that people dig and fill with water for boats","c":"運河","s":"Ships sail through the Panama canal to get from one ocean to the other.","t":"船隻通過巴拿馬運河從一個海洋到另一個海洋。"},{"w":"chemist","p":"n.","d":"a scientist who studies chemistry","c":"化學家；藥劑師","s":"The chemist mixed two liquids in the lab and discovered a new medicine.","t":"化學家在實驗室裡混合兩種液體，發現了一種新藥。"},{"w":"chill","p":"n.","d":"a feeling of cold","c":"寒意","s":"There was a chill in the air, so I put on a sweater.","t":"空氣中有一股寒意，所以我穿上毛衣。"},{"w":"congress","p":"n.","d":"the group of people who make the laws of a country","c":"國會","s":"The congress passed a new law to protect the forests.","t":"國會通過了一項保護森林的新法律。"},{"w":"dairy","p":"adj.","d":"made from milk","c":"乳製品的","s":"Cheese and butter are dairy products that I eat every day.","t":"起司和奶油是我每天都吃的乳製品。"},{"w":"descend","p":"v.","d":"to go down","c":"下降","s":"The plane began to descend slowly toward the airport.","t":"飛機開始緩緩朝機場下降。"},{"w":"grocer","p":"n.","d":"a person who owns a shop that sells food and things for the home","c":"雜貨商","s":"The grocer on our street sells fresh vegetables, rice, and eggs.","t":"我們街上的雜貨商賣新鮮蔬菜、米和蛋。"},{"w":"hesitate","p":"v.","d":"to stop for a moment before doing something because you are not sure","c":"猶豫","s":"If you have any questions, don't hesitate to ask me.","t":"如果你有任何問題，別猶豫，儘管問我。"},{"w":"institution","p":"n.","d":"a large, important organization such as a university or a bank","c":"機構","s":"The university is the oldest institution of higher learning in the country.","t":"這所大學是全國最古老的高等教育機構。"},{"w":"jog","p":"v.","d":"to run slowly for exercise","c":"慢跑","s":"I jog around the park for thirty minutes every morning.","t":"我每天早上繞著公園慢跑三十分鐘。"},{"w":"merchant","p":"n.","d":"a person who buys and sells goods in large amounts","c":"商人","s":"The rich merchant traded silk and tea between China and Europe.","t":"那位富商在中國和歐洲之間做絲綢和茶葉的貿易。"},{"w":"poke","p":"v.","d":"to push a finger or a pointed object into someone or something","c":"戳","s":"Don't poke the sleeping dog with that stick; it may bite you.","t":"別用那根棍子戳睡著的狗，牠可能會咬你。"},{"w":"postpone","p":"v.","d":"to arrange for something to happen at a later time","c":"延期","s":"We had to postpone the picnic until next week because of the rain.","t":"因為下雨，我們不得不把野餐延到下週。"},{"w":"splash","p":"v.","d":"(of liquid) to fall or hit something in drops","c":"濺；潑","s":"The children love to jump in the pool and splash water on each other.","t":"孩子們喜歡跳進泳池互相潑水。"},{"w":"stubborn","p":"adj.","d":"refusing to change your mind","c":"固執的","s":"My stubborn grandfather will not see a doctor, no matter how sick he is.","t":"我固執的爺爺不管病得多重都不肯看醫生。"},{"w":"suburb","p":"n.","d":"an area on the edge of a city where people live","c":"郊區","s":"They moved from the city center to a quiet suburb with more trees and parks.","t":"他們從市中心搬到一個有更多樹和公園的安靜郊區。"},{"w":"tide","p":"n.","d":"the regular rise and fall of the sea","c":"潮汐","s":"When the tide goes out, you can walk across the sand to the small island.","t":"退潮時，你可以踩著沙灘走到那座小島。"},{"w":"tragedy","p":"n.","d":"a very sad event, especially one in which people die","c":"悲劇","s":"The plane crash was a terrible tragedy that killed two hundred people.","t":"那場墜機是奪走兩百條人命的可怕悲劇。"}]},{"unit":29,"theme":"bomb – trace","cards":[{"w":"bomb","p":"n.","d":"a weapon that explodes and causes great damage","c":"炸彈","s":"The police found a bomb in a bag at the train station and moved everyone out.","t":"警方在火車站的一個袋子裡發現炸彈，並疏散了所有人。"},{"w":"certificate","p":"n.","d":"an official paper that proves a fact, such as a birth or a finished course","c":"證書","s":"She received a certificate after finishing the six-month cooking course.","t":"完成六個月的烹飪課程後，她拿到一張證書。"},{"w":"circumstance","p":"n.","d":"a fact or condition that affects a situation","c":"情況","s":"Under no circumstance should you open the door to a stranger.","t":"在任何情況下你都不應該給陌生人開門。"},{"w":"coffin","p":"n.","d":"a long box in which a dead person is buried","c":"棺材","s":"Six men carried the coffin slowly to the grave.","t":"六個人緩緩地把棺材抬到墓地。"},{"w":"cope","p":"v.","d":"to deal successfully with a difficult situation","c":"應付；處理","s":"It is hard to cope with three small children and a full-time job.","t":"要同時應付三個小孩和一份全職工作很困難。"},{"w":"criticism","p":"n.","d":"remarks that say what is bad about someone or something","c":"批評","s":"The new movie received a lot of criticism for being too long and boring.","t":"這部新電影因為太長又無聊而受到許多批評。"},{"w":"devastate","p":"v.","d":"to destroy a place completely","c":"摧毀","s":"A typhoon this strong could devastate every village on the coast.","t":"這麼強的颱風可能會摧毀沿海的每一個村莊。"},{"w":"frown","p":"v.","d":"to bring your eyebrows together because you are angry or worried","c":"皺眉","s":"Teachers frown when students come to class without their homework.","t":"學生沒帶作業來上課時，老師會皺眉頭。"},{"w":"gaze","p":"v.","d":"to look at something for a long time","c":"凝視","s":"On clear nights, we like to lie on the grass and gaze at the stars.","t":"在晴朗的夜晚，我們喜歡躺在草地上凝視星星。"},{"w":"glance","p":"v.","d":"to look at something very quickly","c":"瞥見","s":"I only had time to glance at the newspaper before I left for work.","t":"出門上班前，我只有時間瞄一眼報紙。"},{"w":"grief","p":"n.","d":"very great sadness, especially after someone dies","c":"悲傷","s":"The whole family was full of grief when the grandfather died.","t":"祖父過世時，全家人都非常悲痛。"},{"w":"groom","p":"n.","d":"a man who is getting married","c":"新郎","s":"The groom waited nervously at the church for his bride to arrive.","t":"新郎緊張地在教堂等待新娘到來。"},{"w":"license","p":"n.","d":"an official paper that allows you to do something","c":"執照","s":"You must be eighteen to get a driver's license in Taiwan.","t":"在台灣必須滿十八歲才能考駕照。"},{"w":"microscope","p":"n.","d":"a tool that makes very small things look bigger","c":"顯微鏡","s":"We looked at a drop of pond water under a microscope in science class.","t":"自然課上，我們用顯微鏡觀察一滴池塘水。"},{"w":"nuclear","p":"adj.","d":"using the energy that is produced when atoms are split","c":"核能的","s":"The country gets half of its electricity from nuclear power plants.","t":"該國有一半的電力來自核能發電廠。"},{"w":"portray","p":"v.","d":"to show or describe someone or something in a picture, book, or movie","c":"描繪","s":"The movie tries to portray the life of a poor farmer in the 1930s.","t":"這部電影試圖描繪一九三○年代一位貧農的生活。"},{"w":"rotate","p":"v.","d":"to turn around a central point","c":"旋轉","s":"The earth takes twenty-four hours to rotate once.","t":"地球自轉一圈需要二十四小時。"},{"w":"souvenir","p":"n.","d":"something you buy or keep to remember a place or a trip","c":"紀念品","s":"I bought a small Eiffel Tower as a souvenir of my trip to Paris.","t":"我買了一個小艾菲爾鐵塔作為巴黎之旅的紀念品。"},{"w":"submarine","p":"n.","d":"a ship that can travel under water","c":"潛水艇","s":"The submarine stayed deep under the sea for three months.","t":"那艘潛水艇在深海下停留了三個月。"},{"w":"trace","p":"v.","d":"to follow the marks or signs that someone or something has left","c":"追蹤；描繪","s":"The police used his phone to trace the missing boy to a house in the mountains.","t":"警方利用他的手機追蹤到失蹤男孩在山上的一間屋子。"}]},{"unit":30,"theme":"coastline – tolerate","cards":[{"w":"coastline","p":"n.","d":"the land along the edge of the sea","c":"海岸線","s":"Taiwan has a long, beautiful coastline with many beaches and cliffs.","t":"台灣有漫長而美麗的海岸線，沿途有許多海灘和懸崖。"},{"w":"deter","p":"v.","d":"to make someone decide not to do something","c":"阻止；威懾","s":"The store put up cameras to deter people from stealing.","t":"這家店裝了攝影機以嚇阻人們偷竊。"},{"w":"devise","p":"v.","d":"to invent a new way of doing something","c":"設計；發明","s":"The students had to devise a plan to raise money for the trip.","t":"學生們必須想出一個為旅行籌款的計畫。"},{"w":"distance","p":"n.","d":"the amount of space between two places","c":"距離","s":"The distance between my home and the school is only two kilometers.","t":"我家和學校之間的距離只有兩公里。"},{"w":"expertise","p":"n.","d":"special skill or knowledge in a subject","c":"專業知識","s":"We need a doctor with expertise in children's heart diseases.","t":"我們需要一位在兒童心臟疾病方面具有專業知識的醫生。"},{"w":"fracture","p":"n.","d":"a break or crack in a bone","c":"骨折；破裂","s":"The X-ray showed a small fracture in the bone of his left arm.","t":"X光顯示他左手臂的骨頭有一處小裂痕。"},{"w":"headache","p":"n.","d":"a pain in your head","c":"頭痛","s":"I have a bad headache, so I am going to take some medicine and lie down.","t":"我頭很痛，所以要吃點藥躺一下。"},{"w":"implement","p":"v.","d":"to start using a plan or system","c":"實施；執行","s":"The school will implement the new rules at the start of next term.","t":"學校將在下學期開始時實施新規定。"},{"w":"insight","p":"n.","d":"a clear and deep understanding of something","c":"洞察力","s":"The book gives readers a real insight into the life of a soldier.","t":"這本書讓讀者對軍人的生活有真正深入的了解。"},{"w":"limb","p":"n.","d":"a large branch of a tree; an arm or a leg","c":"樹枝；肢體","s":"The storm broke a heavy limb off the old oak tree.","t":"暴風雨把老橡樹的一根粗樹枝折斷了。"},{"w":"might","p":"n.","d":"great power or strength","c":"力量","s":"He pushed the door with all his might, but it would not open.","t":"他用盡全力推門，但門就是打不開。"},{"w":"optimism","p":"n.","d":"the feeling that good things will happen","c":"樂觀","s":"Even after losing three games, the coach was full of optimism about the next one.","t":"即使輸了三場比賽，教練對下一場仍充滿樂觀。"},{"w":"proficient","p":"adj.","d":"able to do something very well","c":"精通的","s":"After five years in France, she became proficient in French.","t":"在法國住了五年後，她的法語變得很流利。"},{"w":"raft","p":"n.","d":"a flat boat made of pieces of wood tied together","c":"木筏","s":"The boys tied some logs together to make a raft and floated down the river.","t":"男孩們把幾根木頭綁在一起做成木筏，順流而下。"},{"w":"ridge","p":"n.","d":"a long, narrow top of a mountain or hill","c":"山脊","s":"We walked along the ridge and looked down at the valleys on both sides.","t":"我們沿著山脊走，俯瞰兩側的山谷。"},{"w":"shoulder","p":"n.","d":"the part of the body between the neck and the top of the arm","c":"肩膀","s":"He carried his little daughter on his shoulder so that she could see the parade.","t":"他把小女兒扛在肩膀上，讓她看得到遊行。"},{"w":"shove","p":"v.","d":"to push someone or something roughly","c":"推擠","s":"Please wait in line and don't shove the people in front of you.","t":"請排隊，不要推擠前面的人。"},{"w":"spouse","p":"n.","d":"a husband or a wife","c":"配偶","s":"Each worker may bring a spouse to the company dinner.","t":"每位員工可以帶配偶參加公司晚宴。"},{"w":"thrust","p":"v.","d":"to push something somewhere suddenly and hard","c":"猛推","s":"I saw him thrust the letter into his pocket when his mother walked in.","t":"我看到他在母親走進來時把信猛塞進口袋。"},{"w":"tolerate","p":"v.","d":"to accept something that you do not like","c":"忍受","s":"Our teacher will not tolerate cheating on tests.","t":"我們老師不會容忍考試作弊。"}]}];
